ad9bc226-2a10-4da5-8890-8450dc769959	01a10290-23bc-7671-9951-bc999a1ffc75	<p>\\( \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc}c &amp; -5 &amp; -6 \\\\ 5 &amp; 2 c^{} &amp; 3 \\\\ b &amp; -3 &amp; \\dot{c}\\end{array}\\right] \\) ম্যাট্রিক্সটি বক্র-প্রতিসম হলে \\( c+b= \\) ?</p>	<p><span>আমরা জানি, কোনো ম্যাট্রিক্স বক্র-প্রতিসম হলে তার মূখ্য কর্ণ বরাবর ভূক্তিগুলো 0 এবং অন্য যেকোন ভূক্তির জন্য</span> \\( a_{\\mathrm{ij}}=-\\mathrm{a}_{\\mathrm{j} i} \\) হয়।</p><p>\\( \\begin{array}{l} \\therefore c=2 c=c=0 \\\\ \\text { এবং } a_{31}=b=-a_{13}=-6\\left[\\because \\mathrm{a}_{13}=-6\\right] \\\\ \\therefore b=6 \\\\ \\therefore c+b=0+(6)=6 \\text { (Ans.) } \\end{array} \\)</p>	2	1
2399a39d-0ff7-4542-b2c9-6115ee3afec5	01a10290-23bc-7671-9951-bc999a1ffc75	<p>\\( \\mathrm{A}^{-1} \\) <span>নির্ণয় কর</span>।</p>	<p><span>দেওয়া আছে</span>, \\( \\mathrm{A}=\\left[\\begin{array}{rrr}4 &amp; 1 &amp; 5 \\\\ -2 &amp; -1 &amp; -3 \\\\ 3 &amp; -4 &amp; -9\\end{array}\\right] \\) </p><p>\\( |A|=4(9-12)-1(18+9)+5(8+3)=16 \\neq 0 \\) </p><p>\\( \\therefore \\mathrm{A}^{-1} \\) <span>নির্ণয়যোগ্য</span>। </p><p>\\( \\begin{array}{l} \\operatorname{adj} A=\\left[\\begin{array}{rrr} \\left|\\begin{array}{rr} -1 &amp; -3 \\\\ -4 &amp; -9 \\end{array}\\right| &amp; -\\left|\\begin{array}{rr} -2 &amp; -3 \\\\ 3 &amp; -9 \\end{array}\\right| &amp; \\left|\\begin{array}{rr} -2 &amp; -1 \\\\ 3 &amp; -4 \\end{array}\\right| \\\\ -\\left|\\begin{array}{rr} r &amp; 5 \\\\ -4 &amp; -9 \\end{array}\\right| &amp; \\left|\\begin{array}{rr} 4 &amp; 5 \\\\ 3 &amp; -9 \\end{array}\\right| &amp; -\\left|\\begin{array}{rr} 4 &amp; 1 \\\\ 3 &amp; -4 \\end{array}\\right| \\\\ \\qquad\\left|\\begin{array}{rr} 1 &amp; 5 \\\\ -1 &amp; -3 \\end{array}\\right| &amp; -\\left|\\begin{array}{rr} 4 &amp; 5 \\\\ -2 &amp; -3 \\end{array}\\right| &amp; \\left|\\begin{array}{rr} 4 &amp; 1 \\\\ -2 &amp; -1 \\end{array}\\right| \\end{array}\\right]^{t} \\\\ =\\left[\\begin{array}{rrr} -3 &amp; -27 &amp; 11 \\\\ -11 &amp; -51 &amp; 19 \\\\ 2 &amp; 2 &amp; -2 \\end{array}\\right]^{t}=\\left[\\begin{array}{rrr} -3 &amp; -11 &amp; 2 \\\\ -27 &amp; -51 &amp; 2 \\\\ 11 &amp; 19 &amp; -2 \\end{array}\\right] \\\\ \\therefore A^{-1}=\\frac{1}{|A|} \\text { adj } A=\\frac{1}{16}\\left[\\begin{array}{rrr} -3 &amp; -11 &amp; 2 \\\\ -27 &amp; -51 &amp; 2 \\\\ 11 &amp; 19 &amp; -2 \\end{array}\\right] \\text { (Ans.) } \\\\ \\end{array} \\)</p>	4	2
2253318e-2a2d-4518-9bbf-c83c67b5d348	01a10290-23bc-7671-9951-bc999a1ffc75	<p><span>দেখাও যে</span>, \\( |B|=4 a^{2} b^{2} c^{2} \\)</p>	<p>বামপক্ষ \\( =|B|=\\left|\\begin{array}{ccc}a^{2} &amp; b c &amp; c a+c^{2} \\\\ a^{2}+a b &amp; b^{2} &amp; c a \\\\ a b &amp; b^{2}+b c &amp; c^{2}\\end{array}\\right| \\)</p><p>\\( =a b c\\left|\\begin{array}{ccc}a &amp; c &amp; a+c \\\\ a+b &amp; b &amp; a \\\\ b &amp; b+c, &amp; c\\end{array}\\right| \\)</p><p>\\( =a b c\\left|\\begin{array}{ccc}0 &amp; c &amp; a+c \\\\ 2 b &amp; b &amp; a \\\\ 2 b &amp; b+c &amp; c\\end{array}\\right|\\left[c_{1}^{\\prime}=\\left(c_{1}+c_{2}\\right)-c_{3}\\right. \\) প্রয়োগ করেে \\( ] \\)</p><p>\\( \\begin{array}{l}=2 b \\times a b c\\left|\\begin{array}{ccc}0 &amp; c &amp; a+c \\\\ 1 &amp; b &amp; a \\\\ 1 &amp; b+c &amp; c\\end{array}\\right| \\\\ =2 a b^{2} c\\left|\\begin{array}{ccc}0 &amp; c &amp; a+c \\\\ 0 &amp; -c &amp; a-c \\\\ 1 &amp; b+c &amp; c\\end{array}\\right| \\quad\\left[r_{2}^{\\prime}=r_{2}-r_{3} \\text { প্রয়োগ করে] }\\right. \\\\ =2 a b^{2} c\\left|\\begin{array}{cc}c &amp; a+c \\\\ -c &amp; a-c\\end{array}\\right| \\text { (১ম কলাম সাপেক্ষে বিস্তার করে) } \\\\ =2 a b^{2} c^{2}\\left|\\begin{array}{cc}1 &amp; a+c \\\\ -1 &amp; a-c\\end{array}\\right|=2 a b^{2} c^{2}(a-c+a+c) \\text { } \\\\ =2 a b^{2} c^{2}(2 a)=4 a^{2} b^{2} c^{2} \\\\ \\therefore|\\mathrm{B}|=4 \\mathrm{a}^{2} \\mathrm{~b}^{2} \\mathrm{c}^{2} \\text { (প্রমাণিত) } \\\\\\end{array} \\)</p>	4	3
6c39c5b7-a656-4f3a-8d79-690c738bff72	01a102b6-7a8c-7026-99a3-779a63e9cd32	<p>\\( c \\) এর মান কত হলে, \\( y=c x(2+x) \\) বক্ররেখার মূলবিন্দুতে স্পর্শকটি \\( x \\) অক্ষের সাথে \\( 60^{\\circ} \\) কোণ উৎপন্ন করবে?</p>	<p>দেওয়া আছে, \\( y=c x(2+x)=2 c x+c x^{2} \\) </p><p>\\( \\therefore \\frac{\\mathrm{dy}}{\\mathrm{dx}}=.2 \\mathrm{c}+2 \\mathrm{cx} \\)  </p><p><span>মূলবিন্দুতে ঢাল</span>, \\( \\left.\\frac{\\mathrm{dy}}{\\mathrm{dx}}\\right|_{(0,0)}=2 \\mathrm{c}+2 \\mathrm{c} .0=2 \\mathrm{c} \\) </p><p><span>শর্তমতে</span>, \\( 2 c=\\tan 60^{\\circ}=\\sqrt{3} \\quad \\therefore c=\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2} \\) (Ans.)</p>	2	1
aa1d75fd-f303-4d6f-9096-efb122ed3217	01a102b6-7a8c-7026-99a3-779a63e9cd32	<p>প্রমাণ কর যে, \\( \\left(m^{2}+x^{2}\\right) y_{2}+x y_{1}=0 \\)</p>	<p>দেওয়া আছে, \\( y=\\ln \\left(x+\\sqrt{m^{2}+x^{2}}\\right) \\) </p><p>বা, \\( y_{1}=\\frac{1}{x+\\sqrt{m^{2}+x^{2}}}\\left(1+\\frac{1}{2 \\sqrt{m^{2}+x^{2}}} 2 x\\right) \\) </p><p>বা, \\( y_{1}=\\frac{1}{x+\\sqrt{m^{2}+x^{2}}} \\times \\frac{x+\\sqrt{m^{2}+x^{2}}}{\\sqrt{m^{2}+x^{2}}} \\) </p><p>বা, \\( \\sqrt{\\mathrm{m}^{2}+\\mathrm{x}^{2}} \\cdot \\mathrm{y}_{1}=1 \\) </p><p>বা, \\( \\left(m^{2}+x^{2}\\right) y_{1}{ }^{2}=1 \\), [উভয় পক্ষকে বর্গ করে] </p><p>বা, \\( \\left(m^{2}+x^{2}\\right) 2 y_{1} y_{2}+2 x y_{1}{ }^{2}=0 \\) </p><p>\\( \\therefore\\left(\\mathrm{m}^{2}+\\mathrm{x}^{2}\\right) \\mathrm{y}_{2}+\\mathrm{xy}_{1}=0 \\) (প্রমাণিত)</p>	4	2
498292ba-3c43-45c2-b175-4390e475f39e	01a102b6-7a8c-7026-99a3-779a63e9cd32	<p>দেখাও যে, \\( h(x) \\) <span>এর সর্বনিম্ন মান</span> \\( \\mathrm{e} \\)</p>	<p>অনুরূপ।</p><p><span>প্রদত্ত রাশি</span> \\( =\\frac{e^{F(x)}}{F(x)}=\\frac{e^{\\ln x}}{\\ln x}=\\frac{x}{\\ln x} \\quad \\operatorname{} \\) </p><p><span>মনে করি</span>, \\( f(x)=y=\\frac{x}{\\ln x} \\therefore \\frac{d y}{d x}=\\frac{\\ln x \\cdot 1-x \\cdot \\frac{1}{x}}{(\\ln x)^{2}}=\\frac{\\ln x-1}{(\\ln x)^{2}} \\) </p><p><span>এবং</span> \\( \\frac{\\mathrm{d}^{2} \\mathrm{y}}{\\mathrm{dx}}=\\frac{(\\ln x)^{2} \\cdot \\frac{1}{x}-(\\ln x-1) \\ 2 \\ln x \\cdot \\frac{1}{x}}{(\\ln x)^{4}} \\) </p><p>\\( =\\frac{\\frac{\\ln x}{x}(\\ln x-2 \\ln x+2)}{(\\ln x)^{4}}=\\frac{2-\\ln x}{x(\\ln x)^{3}} \\)  </p><p><span>সর্বোচ্চ ও সর্বনিম্ন মানের জন্য</span>, \\( \\frac{d y}{d x}=0 \\) </p><p>বা, \\( \\frac{\\ln x-1}{(\\ln x)^{2}}=0 \\) বা, \\( \\ln x-1=0 \\) বা, \\( \\ln x=1=\\ln e \\quad \\therefore x=e \\) </p><p>\\( \\mathrm{x}=\\mathrm{e} \\) হলে, \\( \\frac{\\mathrm{d}^{2} \\mathrm{y}}{\\mathrm{dx}}=\\frac{2-\\ln \\mathrm{e}}{\\mathrm{e}(\\ln \\mathrm{e})^{3}}=\\frac{2-1}{\\mathrm{e} \\cdot 1^{3}}=\\frac{1}{\\mathrm{e}}&gt;0 \\) </p><p><span>সুতরাং </span>\\(x=e\\)<span> বিন্দুতে </span>\\(f(x)\\)<span> ফাংশনটির ক্ষুদ্রতম মান বিদ্যমান।</span></p><p>\\( \\therefore \\) <span>ফাংশনটির ক্ষুদ্রতম মান</span> \\( =\\mathrm{f}(\\mathrm{e})=\\frac{\\mathrm{e}}{\\ln \\mathrm{e}}=\\frac{\\mathrm{e}}{1}=\\mathrm{e} \\) (Ans.)</p>	4	3
24bbbd7f-d483-46f3-951e-c01b7c811b80	01a102d0-3950-7683-9c13-6a935aa5e4fa	<p>\\( 3\\left(x^{2}+y^{2}\\right)-6 x+3 y+1=0 \\) বৃত্তের কেন্দ্র ও ব্যাসার্ধ নির্ণয় কর।</p>	<p><span>প্রদত্ত বৃত্তের সমীকরণ,</span></p><p><span>3(x²+y²)-6x+3y+1=0</span></p><p>\\( \\therefore \\) \\( x^{2}+y^{2}-2 x+y+\\frac{1}{3}=0 \\)</p><p>\\( \\therefore \\) <span>কেন্দ্রের স্থানাঙ্ক </span>\\( \\left(1,-\\frac{1}{2}\\right) \\)</p><p><span>এবং ব্যাসার্ধ </span>\\( =\\sqrt{1^{2}+\\left(-\\frac{1}{2}\\right)^{2}-\\frac{1}{3}}=\\sqrt{1+\\frac{1}{4}-\\frac{1}{3}} \\)</p><p>\\( =\\sqrt{\\frac{11}{12}} \\) <span>একক (Ans.)</span></p>	2	1
0221a5ed-18c4-4b72-8ce0-9bcd0cac1d04	01a102d0-3950-7683-9c13-6a935aa5e4fa	<p>একটি বৃত্ত (3,-2) ও (-2, 0) বিন্দুগামী এবং (i) নং রেখার উপর বৃত্তটির কেন্দ্র । বৃত্তটির সমীকরণ নির্ণয় কর।</p>	<p><span>ধরি, বৃত্তটির সমীকরণ,</span></p><p><span>x² + y² + 2gx + 2fy + c = 0………….(i)</span></p><p><span>বৃত্তটির কেন্দ্র (-g, -f), 2x - y = 3 সরলরেখার ওপর অবস্থিত।</span></p><p><span>সুতরাং - 2g + f = 3 </span>\\( \\therefore \\)<span> f = 3 + 2g…………(ii)</span></p><p><span>(i) নং (-2, 0) বিন্দুগামী।</span></p><p>\\( (-2)^{2}+0^{2}+2 \\mathrm{~g}(-2)+2 \\mathrm{f} .0+\\mathrm{c}=0 \\)</p><p><span>বা, 4 - 4g + c = 0</span><br />\\( \\therefore \\) <span>c = 4g - 4…….(iii)</span></p><p><span>(i) নং (3,-2) বিন্দুগামী।</span></p><p>\\( 3^{2}+(-2)^{2}+2 g(3)+2 f(-2)+c=0 \\)</p><p><span>বা, 13 + 6g -4(3+2g) + 4g - 4 = 0 [(ii) ও (iii) নং হতে)</span></p><p><span>বা, 2g - 3 = 0 </span>\\( \\therefore g=\\frac{3}{2} \\)</p><p><span>g এর মান (ii) নং এ বসিয়ে পাই,</span></p><p>\\( f=3+2\\left(\\frac{3}{2}\\right)=3+3=6 \\)</p><p><span>g এর মান (iii) নং এ বসিয়ে পাই,</span></p><p>\\( c=4\\left(\\frac{3}{2}\\right)-4=6-4=2 \\)</p><p><span>g, f ও c এর মান (i) নং এ বসিয়ে পাই,</span></p><p>\\( \\begin{array}{l}\\mathrm{x}^{2}+\\mathrm{y}^{2}+2\\left(\\frac{3}{2}\\right) \\mathrm{x}+2(6) \\mathrm{y}+2=0 \\\\ \\therefore \\mathrm{x}^{2}+\\mathrm{y}^{2}+3 \\mathrm{x}+12 \\mathrm{y}+2=0 \\text { (Ans.) }\\end{array} \\)</p>	4	2
48d161ac-f7fd-43b6-8ff3-7e012e556201	01a102d0-3950-7683-9c13-6a935aa5e4fa	<p><span>(ii) নং বৃত্তে অঙ্কিত স্পর্শক </span>\\( 5 x-12 y-9=0 \\) <span>রেখার সমান্তরাল হলে, স্পর্শকের সমীকরণ নির্ণয় কর।</span></p>	<p>প্রদত্ত বৃত্তের সমীকরণ, x²+ y² - 8x - 16y - 8 = 0 ...... ..(i)</p><p>এবং রেখার সমীকরণ, 5x - 12y -9 = 0......(ii)</p><p>(i) নং বৃত্তের কেন্দ্রের স্থানাঙ্ক (4, 8)</p><p>এবং ব্যাসার্ধ \\( =\\sqrt{16+64+8}=\\sqrt{88} \\) একক</p><p>(ii) নং রেখার সমান্তরাল রেখার সমীকরণ,</p><p>5x - 12y + k = 0... ... ...(iii)</p><p>এখন, (iii) নং রেখাটি বৃত্তের স্পর্শক হলে, কেন্দ্র হতে রেখাটির ওপর অঙ্কিত লম্বদূরত্ব বৃত্তের ব্যাসার্ধের সমান হবে।</p><p>\\( \\begin{array}{l}\\therefore \\frac{|5.4-| 2.8+k \\mid}{\\sqrt{5^{2}+(12)^{2}}}=\\sqrt{88} \\\\ \\text { বা, } \\frac{|k-76|}{\\sqrt{25+144}}=\\sqrt{88} \\\\ \\text { বা, } \\frac{|k-76|}{\\sqrt{169}}=\\sqrt{88} \\\\ \\text { বা, } \\frac{k-76}{13}= \\pm \\sqrt{88} \\\\ \\therefore k= \\pm 13 \\sqrt{88}+76= \\pm 26 \\sqrt{22}+76\\end{array} \\)</p><p>\\( \\therefore \\) নির্ণেয় স্পর্শকের সমীকরণ, \\( 5 x-12 y \\pm 26 \\sqrt{22}+76=0 \\) (Ans.)</p>	4	3
d7c7ebd5-a78e-460b-b329-6afa6b9d226d	01a102b8-9479-77f2-bacc-d3e03d27a133	<p></p><p>প্রমাণ কর যে, \\(\\left[\\begin{array}{rr}4 &amp; 3 \\\\ -4 &amp; -3\\end{array}\\right]\\) একটি সমঘাতী ম্যাট্রিক্স।</p><p><br /></p><p></p>	<p></p><p>ধরি, \\(P=\\left[\\begin{array}{rr}4 &amp; 3 \\\\ -4 &amp; -3\\end{array}\\right]\\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\(\\mathrm{P}\\) ম্যাট্রিক্রটি সমঘাতী ম্যাট্রিক্স হলে, \\(\\mathrm{P}^{2}=\\mathrm{P}\\) হবে।</p><p><br /></p><p>এখন, \\(P^{2}=P \\cdot P\\)</p><p>#1<br /></p><p>\\( =\\left[\\begin{array}{rr} 4 &amp; 3 \\\\ -4 &amp; -3 \\end{array}\\right]\\left[\\begin{array}{rr} 4 &amp; 3 \\\\ -4 &amp; -3 \\end{array}\\right] \\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\( =\\left[\\begin{array}{rr} 16-12 &amp; 12-9 \\\\ -16+12 &amp; -12+9 \\end{array}\\right] \\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\( =\\left[\\begin{array}{rr} 4 &amp; 3 \\\\ -4 &amp; -3 \\end{array}\\right]=p \\)</p><p><br /></p><p>যেহেতু \\(\\mathrm{P}^{2}=\\mathrm{P}\\)</p><p><br /></p><p>সুতরাং, \\(\\mathrm{P}=\\left[\\begin{array}{rr}4 &amp; 3 \\\\ -4 &amp; -3\\end{array}\\right]\\) একটি সমঘাতী ম্যাট্রিক। (প্রমাণিত)</p><p>#2</p>	2	1
f6fda6c1-f60d-4b9e-9663-adb07f2f7cf1	01a102b8-9479-77f2-bacc-d3e03d27a133	<p></p><p>উদ্দীপকের সমীকরণগুলোকে \\(\\mathrm{AX}=\\mathrm{B}\\) আকারে প্রকাশ করে দেখাও যে, \\(p q r=1\\), যখন \\(\\operatorname{Det}(A)=0\\) এবং \\(p \\neq q \\neq r\\).</p><p><br /></p><p></p>	<p></p><p>দেওয়া আছে,</p><p><br /></p><p>\\(\\mathrm{px}+\\mathrm{qy}+\\mathrm{rz}=1\\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\( p^{2} x+q^{2} y+r^{2} z=a \\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\( \\left(p^{3}-1\\right) x+\\left(q^{3}-1\\right) y+\\left(r^{3}-1\\right) z=a^{2} \\)</p><p><br /></p><p>বা, \\(\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc}p &amp; q &amp; r \\\\ p^{2} &amp; q^{2} &amp; r^{2} \\\\ p^{3}-1 &amp; q^{3}-1 &amp; r^{3}-1\\end{array}\\right]\\left[\\begin{array}{l}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{array}\\right]=\\left[\\begin{array}{l}1 \\\\ a \\\\ a^{2}\\end{array}\\right]\\)</p><p><br />#1</p><p>বা, \\(A X=B\\); যেখানে \\(A=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc}p &amp; q &amp; r \\\\ p^{2} &amp; q^{2} &amp; r^{2} \\\\ p^{3}-1 &amp; q^{3}-1 &amp; r^{3}-1\\end{array}\\right], X=\\left[\\begin{array}{l}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{array}\\right]\\)</p><p><br /></p><p>এবং \\(B=\\left[\\begin{array}{l}1 \\\\ a \\\\ a^{2}\\end{array}\\right]\\)</p><p><br /></p><p>এখানে, \\(p \\neq q \\neq r\\) এবং \\(\\operatorname{Det}(A)=0\\)</p><p><br /></p><p>এখন, \\(\\operatorname{Det}(A)=\\left|\\begin{array}{ccc}p &amp; q &amp; r \\\\ p^{2} &amp; q^{2} &amp; r^{2} \\\\ p^{3}-1 &amp; q^{3}-1 &amp; r^{3}-1\\end{array}\\right|\\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\( =\\left|\\begin{array}{ccc} p &amp; q &amp; r \\\\ p^{2} &amp; q^{2} &amp; r^{2} \\\\ p^{3} &amp; q^{3} &amp; r^{3} \\end{array}\\right|-\\left|\\begin{array}{ccc} p &amp; q &amp; r \\\\ p^{2} &amp; q^{2} &amp; r^{2} \\\\ 1 &amp; 1 &amp; 1 \\end{array}\\right| \\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\( =p q r\\left|\\begin{array}{ccc} 1 &amp; 1 &amp; 1 \\\\ p &amp; q &amp; r \\\\ p^{2} &amp; q^{2} &amp; r^{2} \\end{array}\\right|-\\left|\\begin{array}{ccc} 1 &amp; 1 &amp; 1 \\\\ p &amp; q &amp; r \\\\ p^{2} &amp; q^{2} &amp; r^{2} \\end{array}\\right| \\)</p><p><br /></p><p>[\\(\\because \\) পাশাপাশি দুইটি সারি বা কলাম পরিবর্তন করলে নির্ণায়কের চিহ্নের পরিবর্তন হয়]</p><p>#2<br /></p><p>\\( =(p q r-1)\\left|\\begin{array}{ccc} 1 &amp; 1 &amp; 1 \\\\ p &amp; q &amp; r \\\\p^{2} &amp; q^{2} &amp; r^{2}\\end{array}\\right| \\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\( =(p q r-1)\\left|\\begin{array}{ccc}0 &amp; 0 &amp; 1 \\\\p-q &amp; q-r &amp; r \\\\p^{2}-q^{2} &amp; q^{2}-r^{2} &amp; r^{2} \\end{array}\\right| \\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\( [c_{1}{ }^{\\prime}=c_{1}-c_{2} \\) এবং \\( c_{2}{ }^{\\prime}=c_{2}-c_{3} \\) প্রয়োগ করে]</p><p><br /></p><p>\\( =(p q r-1)\\left|\\begin{array}{cc} p-q &amp; q-r \\\\ p^{2}-q^{2} &amp; q^{2}-r^{2} \\end{array}\\right| \\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\( =(p q r-1)(p-q)(q-r)\\left|\\begin{array}{cc} 1 &amp; 1 \\\\ p+q &amp; q+r \\end{array}\\right| \\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\( =(p q r-1)(p-q)(q-r)(q+r-p-q) \\)</p><p><br />#3</p><p>\\( =(p q r-1)(p-q)(q-r)(r-p) \\)</p><p><br /></p><p>এখানে, \\(\\operatorname{Det}(A)=0\\)</p><p><br /></p><p>বা, \\( (p q r-1)(p-q)(q-r)(r-p)=0 \\)</p><p><br /></p><p>বা, \\( pqr -1=0 [\\because p \\neq q \\neq r] \\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\( \\therefore p q r=1 \\) (দেখানো হলো) </p><p>#4</p>	4	2
c51541f6-e2df-490c-bde2-cac931bd2c80	01a102b8-9479-77f2-bacc-d3e03d27a133	<p></p><p>p = 1, q = 2, r = –1 হলে, A<sup>–1</sup> নির্ণেয় কর।</p><p><br /></p><p></p>	<p></p><p>বি.দ্র. উদ্দীপকের বর্ণনায় l, m ও n এর কোনো তথ্য নাই, l, m ও n এর পরিবর্তে যথাক্রমে p, q ও r ধরে সমাধান করা হলো:</p><p><br /></p><p>খ-হতে প্রাপ্ত, \\(A=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc}p &amp; q &amp; r \\\\ p^{2} &amp; q^{2} &amp; r^{2} \\\\ p^{3}-1 &amp; q^{3}-1 &amp; r^{3}-1\\end{array}\\right]\\)</p><p>#1<br /></p><p>\\(p=1, q=2\\) এবং \\(r=-1\\) হলে,</p><p><br /></p><p>\\( A =\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc} 1 &amp; 2 &amp; -1 \\\\ 1^{2} &amp; 2^{2} &amp; (-1)^{2} \\\\ 1^{3}-1 &amp; 2^{3}-1 &amp; (-1)^{3}-1 \\end{array}\\right] \\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\( =\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc} 1 &amp; 2 &amp; -1 \\\\ 1 &amp; 4 &amp; 1 \\\\ 1-1 &amp; 8-1 &amp; -1-1 \\end{array}\\right]=\\left[\\begin{array}{rrr} 1 &amp; 2 &amp; -1 \\\\ 1 &amp; 4 &amp; 1 \\\\ 0 &amp; 7 &amp; -2 \\end{array}\\right] \\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\( \\therefore|A| =\\left[\\begin{array}{rrr} 1 &amp; 2 &amp; -1 \\\\ 1 &amp; 4 &amp; 1 \\\\ 0 &amp; 7 &amp; -2 \\end{array} \\mid\\right. \\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\( =1(-8-7)-2(-2-0)-1(7-0) \\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\( =-15+4-7=4-22=-18 \\neq 0 \\)</p><p><br />#2</p><p>\\(A\\) এর সহগুণকসমূহ :</p><p><br /></p><p>\\( A_{11}=\\left|\\begin{array}{rr} 4 &amp; 1 \\\\ 7 &amp; -2 \\end{array}\\right| \\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\(=-8-7=-15 \\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\( A_{12}=-\\left|\\begin{array}{rr} 1 &amp; 1 \\\\ 0 &amp; -2 \\end{array}\\right| \\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\( =-(-2-0)=2 \\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\( A_{13}=\\left|\\begin{array}{ll} 1 &amp; 4 \\\\ 0 &amp; 7 \\end{array}\\right| \\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\( =7-0=7\\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\( A_{21}=-\\left|\\begin{array}{ll} 2 &amp; -1 \\\\ 7 &amp; -2 \\end{array}\\right|\\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\( =-(-4+7)=-3 \\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\( A_{22}=\\left|\\begin{array}{ll} 1 &amp; -1 \\\\ 0 &amp; -2 \\end{array}\\right| \\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\( =-2+0=-2 \\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\( A_{23}=-\\left|\\begin{array}{ll} 1 &amp; 2 \\\\ 0 &amp; 7 \\end{array}\\right| \\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\( =-(7-0)=-7 \\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\( A_{31}=\\left|\\begin{array}{rr} 2 &amp; -1 \\\\ 4 &amp; 1 \\end{array}\\right| \\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\( =2+4=6 \\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\( A_{32}=-\\left|\\begin{array}{rr} 1 &amp; -1 \\\\ 1 &amp; 1 \\end{array}\\right| \\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\( =-(1+1)=-2 \\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\( A_{33}=\\left|\\begin{array}{ll} 1 &amp; 2 \\\\ 1 &amp; 4 \\end{array}\\right| \\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\(=4-2=2 \\)</p><p>#3<br /></p><p>\\( \\therefore \\operatorname{Adj} A=\\left[\\begin{array}{lll} \\mathrm{A}_{11} &amp; \\mathrm{~A}_{12} &amp; \\mathrm{~A}_{13} \\\\ \\mathrm{~A}_{21} &amp; \\mathrm{~A}_{22} &amp; \\mathrm{~A}_{23} \\\\ \\mathrm{~A}_{31} &amp; \\mathrm{~A}_{32} &amp; \\mathrm{~A}_{33} \\end{array}\\right]^{\\mathrm{T}} \\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\( =\\left[\\begin{array}{rrr} -15 &amp; 2 &amp; 7 \\\\ -3 &amp; -2 &amp; -7 \\\\ 6 &amp; -2 &amp; 2 \\end{array}\\right]^{T}=\\left[\\begin{array}{rr} -15 &amp; -3 \\\\ 2 &amp; -2 \\\\ 7 &amp; -7 \\end{array}\\right. \\)</p><p>\\( \\left.\\begin{array}{r} 6 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 2 \\end{array}\\right] \\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\( A^{-1}=\\frac{1}{|A|} \\operatorname{Adj} A=\\frac{1}{-18}\\left[\\begin{array}{rrr} -15 &amp; -3 &amp; 6 \\\\ 2 &amp; -2 &amp; -2 \\\\ 7 &amp; -7 &amp; 2 \\end{array}\\right]=\\frac{1}{18}\\left[\\begin{array}{rrr} 15 &amp; 3 &amp; -6 \\\\ -2 &amp; 2 &amp; 2 \\\\ -7 &amp; 7 &amp; -2 \\end{array}\\right] \\)</p><p><br /></p><p>নির্ণেয় \\( \\mathrm{A}^{-1}=\\frac{1}{18}\\left[\\begin{array}{rrr} 15 &amp; 3 &amp; -6 \\\\ -2 &amp; 2 &amp; 2 \\\\ -7 &amp; 7 &amp; -2 \\end{array}\\right] \\)</p><p>#4</p>	4	3
