t| \\)</p><p><br /></p><p>[\\(\\because \\) পাশাপাশি দুইটি সারি বা কলাম পরিবর্তন করলে নির্ণায়কের চিহ্নের পরিবর্তন হয়]</p><p>#2<br /></p><p>\\( =(p q r-1)\\left|\\begin{array}{ccc} 1 &amp; 1 &amp; 1 \\\\ p &amp; q &amp; r \\\\p^{2} &amp; q^{2} &amp; r^{2}\\end{array}\\right| \\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\( =(p q r-1)\\left|\\begin{array}{ccc}0 &amp; 0 &amp; 1 \\\\p-q &amp; q-r &amp; r \\\\p^{2}-q^{2} &amp; q^{2}-r^{2} &amp; r^{2} \\end{array}\\right| \\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\( [c_{1}{ }^{\\prime}=c_{1}-c_{2} \\) এবং \\( c_{2}{ }^{\\prime}=c_{2}-c_{3} \\) প্রয়োগ করে]</p><p><br /></p><p>\\( =(p q r-1)\\left|\\begin{array}{cc} p-q &amp; q-r \\\\ p^{2}-q^{2} &amp; q^{2}-r^{2} \\end{array}\\right| \\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\( =(p q r-1)(p-q)(q-r)\\left|\\begin{array}{cc} 1 &amp; 1 \\\\ p+q &amp; q+r \\end{array}\\right| \\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\( =(p q r-1)(p-q)(q-r)(q+r-p-q) \\)</p><p><br />#3</p><p>\\( =(p q r-1)(p-q)(q-r)(r-p) \\)</p><p><br /></p><p>এখানে, \\(\\operatorname{Det}(A)=0\\)</p><p><br /></p><p>বা, \\( (p q r-1)(p-q)(q-r)(r-p)=0 \\)</p><p><br /></p><p>বা, \\( pqr -1=0 [\\because p \\neq q \\neq r] \\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\( \\therefore p q r=1 \\) (দেখানো হলো) </p><p>#4</p>	4	2
6bbcdb1f-b4c0-4d4b-8ab6-01bb40489dd1	01a102be-fc08-7244-8b82-7ea1762d4a35	<p></p><p>p = 1, q = 2, r = –1 হলে, A<sup>–1</sup> নির্ণেয় কর।</p><p><br /></p><p></p>	<p></p><p>বি.দ্র. উদ্দীপকের বর্ণনায় l, m ও n এর কোনো তথ্য নাই, l, m ও n এর পরিবর্তে যথাক্রমে p, q ও r ধরে সমাধান করা হলো:</p><p><br /></p><p>খ-হতে প্রাপ্ত, \\(A=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc}p &amp; q &amp; r \\\\ p^{2} &amp; q^{2} &amp; r^{2} \\\\ p^{3}-1 &amp; q^{3}-1 &amp; r^{3}-1\\end{array}\\right]\\)</p><p>#1<br /></p><p>\\(p=1, q=2\\) এবং \\(r=-1\\) হলে,</p><p><br /></p><p>\\( A =\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc} 1 &amp; 2 &amp; -1 \\\\ 1^{2} &amp; 2^{2} &amp; (-1)^{2} \\\\ 1^{3}-1 &amp; 2^{3}-1 &amp; (-1)^{3}-1 \\end{array}\\right] \\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\( =\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc} 1 &amp; 2 &amp; -1 \\\\ 1 &amp; 4 &amp; 1 \\\\ 1-1 &amp; 8-1 &amp; -1-1 \\end{array}\\right]=\\left[\\begin{array}{rrr} 1 &amp; 2 &amp; -1 \\\\ 1 &amp; 4 &amp; 1 \\\\ 0 &amp; 7 &amp; -2 \\end{array}\\right] \\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\( \\therefore|A| =\\left[\\begin{array}{rrr} 1 &amp; 2 &amp; -1 \\\\ 1 &amp; 4 &amp; 1 \\\\ 0 &amp; 7 &amp; -2 \\end{array} \\mid\\right. \\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\( =1(-8-7)-2(-2-0)-1(7-0) \\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\( =-15+4-7=4-22=-18 \\neq 0 \\)</p><p><br />#2</p><p>\\(A\\) এর সহগুণকসমূহ :</p><p><br /></p><p>\\( A_{11}=\\left|\\begin{array}{rr} 4 &amp; 1 \\\\ 7 &amp; -2 \\end{array}\\right| \\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\(=-8-7=-15 \\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\( A_{12}=-\\left|\\begin{array}{rr} 1 &amp; 1 \\\\ 0 &amp; -2 \\end{array}\\right| \\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\( =-(-2-0)=2 \\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\( A_{13}=\\left|\\begin{array}{ll} 1 &amp; 4 \\\\ 0 &amp; 7 \\end{array}\\right| \\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\( =7-0=7\\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\( A_{21}=-\\left|\\begin{array}{ll} 2 &amp; -1 \\\\ 7 &amp; -2 \\end{array}\\right|\\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\( =-(-4+7)=-3 \\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\( A_{22}=\\left|\\begin{array}{ll} 1 &amp; -1 \\\\ 0 &amp; -2 \\end{array}\\right| \\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\( =-2+0=-2 \\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\( A_{23}=-\\left|\\begin{array}{ll} 1 &amp; 2 \\\\ 0 &amp; 7 \\end{array}\\right| \\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\( =-(7-0)=-7 \\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\( A_{31}=\\left|\\begin{array}{rr} 2 &amp; -1 \\\\ 4 &amp; 1 \\end{array}\\right| \\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\( =2+4=6 \\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\( A_{32}=-\\left|\\begin{array}{rr} 1 &amp; -1 \\\\ 1 &amp; 1 \\end{array}\\right| \\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\( =-(1+1)=-2 \\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\( A_{33}=\\left|\\begin{array}{ll} 1 &amp; 2 \\\\ 1 &amp; 4 \\end{array}\\right| \\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\(=4-2=2 \\)</p><p>#3<br /></p><p>\\( \\therefore \\operatorname{Adj} A=\\left[\\begin{array}{lll} \\mathrm{A}_{11} &amp; \\mathrm{~A}_{12} &amp; \\mathrm{~A}_{13} \\\\ \\mathrm{~A}_{21} &amp; \\mathrm{~A}_{22} &amp; \\mathrm{~A}_{23} \\\\ \\mathrm{~A}_{31} &amp; \\mathrm{~A}_{32} &amp; \\mathrm{~A}_{33} \\end{array}\\right]^{\\mathrm{T}} \\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\( =\\left[\\begin{array}{rrr} -15 &amp; 2 &amp; 7 \\\\ -3 &amp; -2 &amp; -7 \\\\ 6 &amp; -2 &amp; 2 \\end{array}\\right]^{T}=\\left[\\begin{array}{rr} -15 &amp; -3 \\\\ 2 &amp; -2 \\\\ 7 &amp; -7 \\end{array}\\right. \\)</p><p>\\( \\left.\\begin{array}{r} 6 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 2 \\end{array}\\right] \\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\( A^{-1}=\\frac{1}{|A|} \\operatorname{Adj} A=\\frac{1}{-18}\\left[\\begin{array}{rrr} -15 &amp; -3 &amp; 6 \\\\ 2 &amp; -2 &amp; -2 \\\\ 7 &amp; -7 &amp; 2 \\end{array}\\right]=\\frac{1}{18}\\left[\\begin{array}{rrr} 15 &amp; 3 &amp; -6 \\\\ -2 &amp; 2 &amp; 2 \\\\ -7 &amp; 7 &amp; -2 \\end{array}\\right] \\)</p><p><br /></p><p>নির্ণেয় \\( \\mathrm{A}^{-1}=\\frac{1}{18}\\left[\\begin{array}{rrr} 15 &amp; 3 &amp; -6 \\\\ -2 &amp; 2 &amp; 2 \\\\ -7 &amp; 7 &amp; -2 \\end{array}\\right] \\)</p><p>#4</p>	4	3
