01a1028b-78e8-77c9-bd56-33377cecd5f4	01a1028b-7722-706f-a699-78a50a2af489	<p></p><p>উদ্দীপকের সমীকরণগুলোকে \\(\\mathrm{AX}=\\mathrm{B}\\) আকারে প্রকাশ করে দেখাও যে, \\(p q r=1\\), যখন \\(\\operatorname{Det}(A)=0\\) এবং \\(p \\neq q \\neq r\\).</p><p><br /></p><p></p>	<p></p><p>দেওয়া আছে,</p><p><br /></p><p>\\(\\mathrm{px}+\\mathrm{qy}+\\mathrm{rz}=1\\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\( p^{2} x+q^{2} y+r^{2} z=a \\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\( \\left(p^{3}-1\\right) x+\\left(q^{3}-1\\right) y+\\left(r^{3}-1\\right) z=a^{2} \\)</p><p><br /></p><p>বা, \\(\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc}p &amp; q &amp; r \\\\ p^{2} &amp; q^{2} &amp; r^{2} \\\\ p^{3}-1 &amp; q^{3}-1 &amp; r^{3}-1\\end{array}\\right]\\left[\\begin{array}{l}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{array}\\right]=\\left[\\begin{array}{l}1 \\\\ a \\\\ a^{2}\\end{array}\\right]\\)</p><p><br />#1</p><p>বা, \\(A X=B\\); যেখানে \\(A=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc}p &amp; q &amp; r \\\\ p^{2} &amp; q^{2} &amp; r^{2} \\\\ p^{3}-1 &amp; q^{3}-1 &amp; r^{3}-1\\end{array}\\right], X=\\left[\\begin{array}{l}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{array}\\right]\\)</p><p><br /></p><p>এবং \\(B=\\left[\\begin{array}{l}1 \\\\ a \\\\ a^{2}\\end{array}\\right]\\)</p><p><br /></p><p>এখানে, \\(p \\neq q \\neq r\\) এবং \\(\\operatorname{Det}(A)=0\\)</p><p><br /></p><p>এখন, \\(\\operatorname{Det}(A)=\\left|\\begin{array}{ccc}p &amp; q &amp; r \\\\ p^{2} &amp; q^{2} &amp; r^{2} \\\\ p^{3}-1 &amp; q^{3}-1 &amp; r^{3}-1\\end{array}\\right|\\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\( =\\left|\\begin{array}{ccc} p &amp; q &amp; r \\\\ p^{2} &amp; q^{2} &amp; r^{2} \\\\ p^{3} &amp; q^{3} &amp; r^{3} \\end{array}\\right|-\\left|\\begin{array}{ccc} p &amp; q &amp; r \\\\ p^{2} &amp; q^{2} &amp; r^{2} \\\\ 1 &amp; 1 &amp; 1 \\end{array}\\right| \\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\( =p q r\\left|\\begin{array}{ccc} 1 &amp; 1 &amp; 1 \\\\ p &amp; q &amp; r \\\\ p^{2} &amp; q^{2} &amp; r^{2} \\end{array}\\right|-\\left|\\begin{array}{ccc} 1 &amp; 1 &amp; 1 \\\\ p &amp; q &amp; r \\\\ p^{2} &amp; q^{2} &amp; r^{2} \\end{array}\\right| \\)</p><p><br /></p><p>[\\(\\because \\) পাশাপাশি দুইটি সারি বা কলাম পরিবর্তন করলে নির্ণায়কের চিহ্নের পরিবর্তন হয়]</p><p>#2<br /></p><p>\\( =(p q r-1)\\left|\\begin{array}{ccc} 1 &amp; 1 &amp; 1 \\\\ p &amp; q &amp; r \\\\p^{2} &amp; q^{2} &amp; r^{2}\\end{array}\\right| \\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\( =(p q r-1)\\left|\\begin{array}{ccc}0 &amp; 0 &amp; 1 \\\\p-q &amp; q-r &amp; r \\\\p^{2}-q^{2} &amp; q^{2}-r^{2} &amp; r^{2} \\end{array}\\right| \\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\( [c_{1}{ }^{\\prime}=c_{1}-c_{2} \\) এবং \\( c_{2}{ }^{\\prime}=c_{2}-c_{3} \\) প্রয়োগ করে]</p><p><br /></p><p>\\( =(p q r-1)\\left|\\begin{array}{cc} p-q &amp; q-r \\\\ p^{2}-q^{2} &amp; q^{2}-r^{2} \\end{array}\\right| \\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\( =(p q r-1)(p-q)(q-r)\\left|\\begin{array}{cc} 1 &amp; 1 \\\\ p+q &amp; q+r \\end{array}\\right| \\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\( =(p q r-1)(p-q)(q-r)(q+r-p-q) \\)</p><p><br />#3</p><p>\\( =(p q r-1)(p-q)(q-r)(r-p) \\)</p><p><br /></p><p>এখানে, \\(\\operatorname{Det}(A)=0\\)</p><p><br /></p><p>বা, \\( (p q r-1)(p-q)(q-r)(r-p)=0 \\)</p><p><br /></p><p>বা, \\( pqr -1=0 [\\because p \\neq q \\neq r] \\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\( \\therefore p q r=1 \\) (দেখানো হলো) </p><p>#4</p>	2	2
01a1028b-79c9-7209-b229-41db71edda1c	01a1028b-7722-706f-a699-78a50a2af489	<p></p><p>p = 1, q = 2, r = –1 হলে, A<sup>–1</sup> নির্ণেয় কর।</p><p><br /></p><p></p>	<p></p><p>বি.দ্র. উদ্দীপকের বর্ণনায় l, m ও n এর কোনো তথ্য নাই, l, m ও n এর পরিবর্তে যথাক্রমে p, q ও r ধরে সমাধান করা হলো:</p><p><br /></p><p>খ-হতে প্রাপ্ত, \\(A=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc}p &amp; q &amp; r \\\\ p^{2} &amp; q^{2} &amp; r^{2} \\\\ p^{3}-1 &amp; q^{3}-1 &amp; r^{3}-1\\end{array}\\right]\\)</p><p>#1<br /></p><p>\\(p=1, q=2\\) এবং \\(r=-1\\) হলে,</p><p><br /></p><p>\\( A =\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc} 1 &amp; 2 &amp; -1 \\\\ 1^{2} &amp; 2^{2} &amp; (-1)^{2} \\\\ 1^{3}-1 &amp; 2^{3}-1 &amp; (-1)^{3}-1 \\end{array}\\right] \\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\( =\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc} 1 &amp; 2 &amp; -1 \\\\ 1 &amp; 4 &amp; 1 \\\\ 1-1 &amp; 8-1 &amp; -1-1 \\end{array}\\right]=\\left[\\begin{array}{rrr} 1 &amp; 2 &amp; -1 \\\\ 1 &amp; 4 &amp; 1 \\\\ 0 &amp; 7 &amp; -2 \\end{array}\\right] \\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\( \\therefore|A| =\\left[\\begin{array}{rrr} 1 &amp; 2 &amp; -1 \\\\ 1 &amp; 4 &amp; 1 \\\\ 0 &amp; 7 &amp; -2 \\end{array} \\mid\\right. \\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\( =1(-8-7)-2(-2-0)-1(7-0) \\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\( =-15+4-7=4-22=-18 \\neq 0 \\)</p><p><br />#2</p><p>\\(A\\) এর সহগুণকসমূহ :</p><p><br /></p><p>\\( A_{11}=\\left|\\begin{array}{rr} 4 &amp; 1 \\\\ 7 &amp; -2 \\end{array}\\right| \\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\(=-8-7=-15 \\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\( A_{12}=-\\left|\\begin{array}{rr} 1 &amp; 1 \\\\ 0 &amp; -2 \\end{array}\\right| \\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\( =-(-2-0)=2 \\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\( A_{13}=\\left|\\begin{array}{ll} 1 &amp; 4 \\\\ 0 &amp; 7 \\end{array}\\right| \\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\( =7-0=7\\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\( A_{21}=-\\left|\\begin{array}{ll} 2 &amp; -1 \\\\ 7 &amp; -2 \\end{array}\\right|\\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\( =-(-4+7)=-3 \\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\( A_{22}=\\left|\\begin{array}{ll} 1 &amp; -1 \\\\ 0 &amp; -2 \\end{array}\\right| \\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\( =-2+0=-2 \\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\( A_{23}=-\\left|\\begin{array}{ll} 1 &amp; 2 \\\\ 0 &amp; 7 \\end{array}\\right| \\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\( =-(7-0)=-7 \\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\( A_{31}=\\left|\\begin{array}{rr} 2 &amp; -1 \\\\ 4 &amp; 1 \\end{array}\\right| \\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\( =2+4=6 \\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\( A_{32}=-\\left|\\begin{array}{rr} 1 &amp; -1 \\\\ 1 &amp; 1 \\end{array}\\right| \\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\( =-(1+1)=-2 \\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\( A_{33}=\\left|\\begin{array}{ll} 1 &amp; 2 \\\\ 1 &amp; 4 \\end{array}\\right| \\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\(=4-2=2 \\)</p><p>#3<br /></p><p>\\( \\therefore \\operatorname{Adj} A=\\left[\\begin{array}{lll} \\mathrm{A}_{11} &amp; \\mathrm{~A}_{12} &amp; \\mathrm{~A}_{13} \\\\ \\mathrm{~A}_{21} &amp; \\mathrm{~A}_{22} &amp; \\mathrm{~A}_{23} \\\\ \\mathrm{~A}_{31} &amp; \\mathrm{~A}_{32} &amp; \\mathrm{~A}_{33} \\end{array}\\right]^{\\mathrm{T}} \\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\( =\\left[\\begin{array}{rrr} -15 &amp; 2 &amp; 7 \\\\ -3 &amp; -2 &amp; -7 \\\\ 6 &amp; -2 &amp; 2 \\end{array}\\right]^{T}=\\left[\\begin{array}{rr} -15 &amp; -3 \\\\ 2 &amp; -2 \\\\ 7 &amp; -7 \\end{array}\\right. \\)</p><p>\\( \\left.\\begin{array}{r} 6 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 2 \\end{array}\\right] \\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\( A^{-1}=\\frac{1}{|A|} \\operatorname{Adj} A=\\frac{1}{-18}\\left[\\begin{array}{rrr} -15 &amp; -3 &amp; 6 \\\\ 2 &amp; -2 &amp; -2 \\\\ 7 &amp; -7 &amp; 2 \\end{array}\\right]=\\frac{1}{18}\\left[\\begin{array}{rrr} 15 &amp; 3 &amp; -6 \\\\ -2 &amp; 2 &amp; 2 \\\\ -7 &amp; 7 &amp; -2 \\end{array}\\right] \\)</p><p><br /></p><p>নির্ণেয় \\( \\mathrm{A}^{-1}=\\frac{1}{18}\\left[\\begin{array}{rrr} 15 &amp; 3 &amp; -6 \\\\ -2 &amp; 2 &amp; 2 \\\\ -7 &amp; 7 &amp; -2 \\end{array}\\right] \\)</p><p>#4</p>	3	3
01a10293-b0c1-748f-9422-b4f11b330271	01a10293-afe1-7051-b3a0-99de30718439	<p>\\( 3\\left(x^{2}+y^{2}\\right)-6 x+3 y+1=0 \\) বৃত্তের কেন্দ্র ও ব্যাসার্ধ নির্ণয় কর।</p>	<p><span>প্রদত্ত বৃত্তের সমীকরণ,</span></p><p><span>3(x²+y²)-6x+3y+1=0</span></p><p>\\( \\therefore \\) \\( x^{2}+y^{2}-2 x+y+\\frac{1}{3}=0 \\)</p><p>\\( \\therefore \\) <span>কেন্দ্রের স্থানাঙ্ক </span>\\( \\left(1,-\\frac{1}{2}\\right) \\)</p><p><span>এবং ব্যাসার্ধ </span>\\( =\\sqrt{1^{2}+\\left(-\\frac{1}{2}\\right)^{2}-\\frac{1}{3}}=\\sqrt{1+\\frac{1}{4}-\\frac{1}{3}} \\)</p><p>\\( =\\sqrt{\\frac{11}{12}} \\) <span>একক (Ans.)</span></p>	1	1
01a10293-b1ea-7490-895f-2969aa707b86	01a10293-afe1-7051-b3a0-99de30718439	<p>একটি বৃত্ত (3,-2) ও (-2, 0) বিন্দুগামী এবং (i) নং রেখার উপর বৃত্তটির কেন্দ্র । বৃত্তটির সমীকরণ নির্ণয় কর।</p>	<p><span>ধরি, বৃত্তটির সমীকরণ,</span></p><p><span>x² + y² + 2gx + 2fy + c = 0………….(i)</span></p><p><span>বৃত্তটির কেন্দ্র (-g, -f), 2x - y = 3 সরলরেখার ওপর অবস্থিত।</span></p><p><span>সুতরাং - 2g + f = 3 </span>\\( \\therefore \\)<span> f = 3 + 2g…………(ii)</span></p><p><span>(i) নং (-2, 0) বিন্দুগামী।</span></p><p>\\( (-2)^{2}+0^{2}+2 \\mathrm{~g}(-2)+2 \\mathrm{f} .0+\\mathrm{c}=0 \\)</p><p><span>বা, 4 - 4g + c = 0</span><br />\\( \\therefore \\) <span>c = 4g - 4…….(iii)</span></p><p><span>(i) নং (3,-2) বিন্দুগামী।</span></p><p>\\( 3^{2}+(-2)^{2}+2 g(3)+2 f(-2)+c=0 \\)</p><p><span>বা, 13 + 6g -4(3+2g) + 4g - 4 = 0 [(ii) ও (iii) নং হতে)</span></p><p><span>বা, 2g - 3 = 0 </span>\\( \\therefore g=\\frac{3}{2} \\)</p><p><span>g এর মান (ii) নং এ বসিয়ে পাই,</span></p><p>\\( f=3+2\\left(\\frac{3}{2}\\right)=3+3=6 \\)</p><p><span>g এর মান (iii) নং এ বসিয়ে পাই,</span></p><p>\\( c=4\\left(\\frac{3}{2}\\right)-4=6-4=2 \\)</p><p><span>g, f ও c এর মান (i) নং এ বসিয়ে পাই,</span></p><p>\\( \\begin{array}{l}\\mathrm{x}^{2}+\\mathrm{y}^{2}+2\\left(\\frac{3}{2}\\right) \\mathrm{x}+2(6) \\mathrm{y}+2=0 \\\\ \\therefore \\mathrm{x}^{2}+\\mathrm{y}^{2}+3 \\mathrm{x}+12 \\mathrm{y}+2=0 \\text { (Ans.) }\\end{array} \\)</p>	2	2
01a10293-b2c5-7320-8700-ccb038aa2d2a	01a10293-afe1-7051-b3a0-99de30718439	<p><span>(ii) নং বৃত্তে অঙ্কিত স্পর্শক </span>\\( 5 x-12 y-9=0 \\) <span>রেখার সমান্তরাল হলে, স্পর্শকের সমীকরণ নির্ণয় কর।</span></p>	<p>প্রদত্ত বৃত্তের সমীকরণ, x²+ y² - 8x - 16y - 8 = 0 ...... ..(i)</p><p>এবং রেখার সমীকরণ, 5x - 12y -9 = 0......(ii)</p><p>(i) নং বৃত্তের কেন্দ্রের স্থানাঙ্ক (4, 8)</p><p>এবং ব্যাসার্ধ \\( =\\sqrt{16+64+8}=\\sqrt{88} \\) একক</p><p>(ii) নং রেখার সমান্তরাল রেখার সমীকরণ,</p><p>5x - 12y + k = 0... ... ...(iii)</p><p>এখন, (iii) নং রেখাটি বৃত্তের স্পর্শক হলে, কেন্দ্র হতে রেখাটির ওপর অঙ্কিত লম্বদূরত্ব বৃত্তের ব্যাসার্ধের সমান হবে।</p><p>\\( \\begin{array}{l}\\therefore \\frac{|5.4-| 2.8+k \\mid}{\\sqrt{5^{2}+(12)^{2}}}=\\sqrt{88} \\\\ \\text { বা, } \\frac{|k-76|}{\\sqrt{25+144}}=\\sqrt{88} \\\\ \\text { বা, } \\frac{|k-76|}{\\sqrt{169}}=\\sqrt{88} \\\\ \\text { বা, } \\frac{k-76}{13}= \\pm \\sqrt{88} \\\\ \\therefore k= \\pm 13 \\sqrt{88}+76= \\pm 26 \\sqrt{22}+76\\end{array} \\)</p><p>\\( \\therefore \\) নির্ণেয় স্পর্শকের সমীকরণ, \\( 5 x-12 y \\pm 26 \\sqrt{22}+76=0 \\) (Ans.)</p>	3	3
