01a10251-620c-709a-a9fd-11629c80120e	\N	mcq	<p>What is the antonym of the word 'pernicious'?</p>	\N	<p>The antonym of the word "pernicious" is "beneficial."</p><ul><li><p>"Pernicious" means having a harmful effect, especially in a gradual or subtle way.</p></li><li><p>"Beneficial," on the other hand, means resulting in good; favorable or advantageous.</p></li></ul><p>The other options:</p><ul><li><p>"Mellifluous" means sweet or musical; pleasant to hear.</p></li><li><p>"Onerous" means involving an amount of effort and difficulty that is oppressively burdensome.</p></li><li><p>"Spurious" means not being what it purports to be; false or fake.</p></li></ul><p>Out of these, "beneficial" is the direct opposite of "pernicious" in terms of meaning, as it signifies a positive or helpful effect as opposed to a harmful one.</p>	published	\N	60	2026-10-03 15:10:50.427576+00	2026-10-03 15:10:50.427576+00
