a=0 \\\\ \\Rightarrow 2 \\alpha=2 \\Rightarrow \\alpha=1 \\\\ \\alpha=1 \\text { হলে, } \\beta=1 \\\\ \\therefore \\text { Ans: } \\alpha=\\beta=1\\end{array} \\) </p>	published	\N	17	2026-10-03 15:12:08.730906+00	2026-10-03 15:12:08.730906+00
