01a1025c-4d08-76c1-b387-33c6589aabbe	01a101fc-a005-7517-bc40-e8451a5a501c	written	<p>সমাধান কর:\\(\\sinθ+\\sin2θ+\\sin3θ=1+\\cosθ+\\cos2θ\\)</p>	\N	<p>\\( \\operatorname{Sin} C+\\operatorname{Sin} D=2 \\operatorname{Sin} \\frac{C+D}{2} \\operatorname{Cos} \\frac{C-D}{2} \\)</p><p>\\( \\operatorname{Cos} 2 \\theta=2 \\operatorname{Cos}^{2} \\theta-1 \\Rightarrow \\operatorname{Cos} 2 \\theta+1=2 \\operatorname{Cos}^{2} \\theta \\)</p><p></p><p>\\( \\begin{aligned} \\text { প্রদত্ত সমীকরণ} &amp; \\Rightarrow \\operatorname{Sin} 3 \\theta+\\operatorname{Sin} \\theta+\\operatorname{Sin} 2 \\theta=1+\\operatorname{Cos} \\theta+\\operatorname{Cos} 2 \\theta \\\\ &amp; \\Rightarrow\\left(2 \\operatorname{Sin} \\frac{3\\theta+\\theta}{2} \\operatorname{Cos} \\frac{3\\theta-\\theta}{2}\\right)+\\operatorname{Sin2} \\theta=2 \\operatorname{Cos}^{2} \\theta+\\operatorname{Cos} \\theta \\\\ &amp; \\Rightarrow 2 \\operatorname{Sin} 2 \\theta \\cdot \\operatorname{Cos} \\theta+\\operatorname{Sin2} \\theta=2 \\operatorname{Cos}^{2} \\theta+\\operatorname{Cos} \\theta \\\\ &amp; =\\operatorname{Sin} 2 \\theta \\cdot(2 \\operatorname{Cos} \\theta+1)=\\operatorname{Cos} \\theta(2 \\operatorname{Cos} \\theta+1) \\\\ &amp; \\Rightarrow \\operatorname{Sin} 2 \\theta(2 \\operatorname{Cos} \\theta+1)-\\operatorname{Cos} \\theta(2 \\operatorname{Cos} \\theta+1)=0 \\\\ &amp; \\Rightarrow(2 \\operatorname{Cos} \\theta+1)(\\operatorname{Sin} 2 \\theta-\\operatorname{Cos} \\theta)=0 ~হয়। \\end{aligned} \\)</p><p>\\( \\begin{array}{l} 2 \\operatorname{Cos} \\theta+1=0 \\\\ \\Rightarrow \\operatorname{Cos} \\theta=-\\frac{1}{2}=\\operatorname{Cos} \\frac{2 \\pi}{3} \\\\ \\theta=2 n \\pi \\pm \\frac{2 \\pi}{3} \\end{array} \\)</p><p>\\( \\operatorname{Cos} \\theta=\\operatorname{Cos} \\alpha \\) হলে,</p><p>\\( \\theta=2 n \\pi \\pm \\alpha \\)</p><p>\\( \\operatorname{Sin2} \\theta=2 \\operatorname{Sin} \\theta \\cdot \\operatorname{Cos} \\theta \\)</p><p>অথবা,</p><p>\\( \\operatorname{Sin} 2 \\theta-\\operatorname{Cos} \\theta=0 \\Rightarrow \\operatorname{2Sin} \\theta \\cdot \\operatorname{Cos} \\theta-\\operatorname{Cos} \\theta=0~হয়। \\)</p><p>\\( \\operatorname{Cos} \\theta=0 \\Rightarrow \\theta=(2 n+1) \\frac{\\pi}{2} \\)</p><p>অথবা, \\( 2 \\operatorname{Sin} \\theta-1=0 \\Rightarrow \\operatorname{Sin} \\theta=\\frac{1}{2} = \\operatorname{Sin} \\frac{\\pi}{6} \\Rightarrow \\theta=n \\pi+(-1)^{n} \\frac{\\pi}{6} \\)</p><p>সমাধান \\( \\Rightarrow \\theta=2 n \\pi \\pm \\frac{2\\pi}{3},(2 n+1) \\frac{\\pi}{2}, n \\pi+(-1)^{n} \\frac{\\pi}{6} \\)</p>	published	\N	5	2026-10-03 15:22:45.944772+00	2026-10-03 15:22:45.944772+00
01a1025c-5499-703b-8091-f86ae92829bb	\N	written	<p><span><span>What is a rhyme? Why do writers use rhyme in poems?</span></span></p>	\N	<p>*A rhyme is a repetition of similar sounding words, occurring at the end of lines in poems or songs.</p><p>*A rhyme is used for the purpose of rendering a pleasing effect to a poem, which makes its recital an enjoyable experience. Sometimes poets use rhymes to reinforce similarities between related concepts. At times rhymes are used to link usually unrelated concepts to add complexity. Rhymes are also used to make a poem memorable. Poets use rhymes to add special flair to their poems which in turn, showcase their wit and humor.</p>	published	\N	6	2026-10-03 15:22:47.881307+00	2026-10-03 15:22:47.881307+00
01a1025c-58ba-7686-8487-5621b1608fe3	01a101fc-a003-71ac-8977-cdedac458fa4	written	<p>একটি স্থির থােরিয়াম নিউক্লিয়াস (A = 220, Z = 90) হতে E<sub>o</sub> গতিশক্তির একটি আলফা কণা নির্গত হয়। বিক্রিয়ায় রেডিয়াম নিউক্লিয়াসের (A = 216,Z = 88) গতিশক্তি কত?</p>	\N	<p>বিক্রিয়া হলো:-</p><p>\\(_{90}Th^{220}\\to_{88}^{216}Ra\\ +\\ _2^4He^{2+}\\)</p><p>এখানে, বিক্রিয়ায় উৎপন্ন শক্তি হবে, (ভর-ত্রুটির সমতুল্য শক্তি)</p><p>\\(Q=\\left\\{M_{Th}-\\left[M_{Ra}+M_a\\right]\\right\\}\\times C^2\\)</p><p>     \\(=\\left\\{220.016-\\left[216.0036+4.0026\\right]\\right\\}\\times C^2\\)</p><p>\\(=\\ 9.614\\times10^{-3}\\ a.m.u\\ =\\ 9.614\\times10^{-3}\\times931.5\\ MeV\\)</p><p>\\(\\therefore\\ Q\\ =\\ 8.951196\\ MeV\\)</p><p>বিক্রিয়ায় উৎপন্ন নিউক্রিয়াস এর গতিশক্তি হবে,</p><p>\\(T_D=\\left(\\frac{M_a}{M_{Ra}}\\right)\\times Q=\\frac{4}{216}\\times8.951196\\ MeV\\)</p><p>        \\(=\\ 0.165762MeV\\)</p>	published	\N	7	2026-10-03 15:22:48.938424+00	2026-10-03 15:22:48.938424+00
