01a1025c-b14c-70d4-9221-76d824485241	01a101fc-a002-7141-81c4-51529e3c7df9	written	<p><span><span>একটি বস্তু সরল দোল গতিতে x = 6.0 cos(6πt + π) m সমীকরণ অনুযায়ী দুলছে। বস্তুর গতির কম্পাঙ্ক কত? t = 2 s সময়ে বস্তটির বেগ ও ত্বরণের মান কত?</span></span></p>	\N	<p>সরল দোল গতিতে দুলায়মান কনার সরনের সাধারণ সমীকরন, \\(x=A\\ Sin\\left(wt+δ\\right)/ACos\\left(wt+s\\right)\\)</p>\n<p>এখানে, \\(x=60\\ Cos\\ \\left(6\\pi+\\pi\\right);\\) তুলনা করে পাই,</p>\n<p>\\(wt=6\\pi t\\) =&gt; \\(w=6\\pi\\ =\\ 2\\pi t\\)   =&gt; \\(t=3\\ Hz\\)</p>\n<p>আবার,</p>\n<p>\\(V=\\frac{dx}{dt}=\\frac{d}{dt}\\left(6\\ Cos\\left(6\\pi t+\\pi\\right)\\right)=6Sin\\left(6\\pi t+\\pi\\right)\\times6\\pi\\)</p>\n<p>এবং \\(V=-36\\pi\\ Sin\\left(6\\pi t+\\pi\\right)\\)</p>\n<p>\\(a=\\frac{dv}{dt}=\\frac{d}{dt}\\left(-36\\ Sin\\left(6\\pi t+\\pi\\right)\\right)=-36\\pi\\ Cos\\left(6\\pi t+\\pi\\right)\\times6\\pi\\)</p>\n<p>               =&gt; \\(a=-216\\pi^2\\ Cos\\left(6\\pi t+\\pi\\right)\\)</p>\n<p>এখন,</p>\n<p>\\(t=2s\\)পর, \\(v=-36\\pi\\ Sin\\left(13\\pi\\right)=0\\ m/s\\)</p>\n<p>                      \\(a=-216\\pi^2\\ Cos\\left(12\\pi+\\pi\\right)=-216\\pi^2\\ Cos\\pi\\)</p>\n<p>                            \\(=-216\\pi^2\\ \\left(-1\\right)=216\\pi^2\\ m/s^2\\)</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\\(\\sin12\\pi=0\\)</p>\n<p>\\(\\sin\\pi=0\\)</p>	published	\N	22	2026-10-03 15:23:11.624779+00	2026-10-03 15:23:11.624779+00
01a1025c-b711-77c4-90b6-0f1132d5aa1c	\N	written	<p>Write six sentences on the importance of biodiversity for our livelihood.</p>	\N	<p>Biodiversity is a term used to describe the enormous variety of life on earth in all its forms and the essential interactions among them. Biodiversity is important for our livelihood for many reasons. Biodiversity provides humans with raw materials for consumption and production. Many livelihoods, such as those of farmers, fishers and timber workers are dependent on biodiversity. Food production, medicinal plants and also manufactured pharmaceuticals rely on biodiversity. As biodiversity boosts our economic productivity, we must protect and preserve it for our livelihood.</p>	published	\N	23	2026-10-03 15:23:13.089605+00	2026-10-03 15:23:13.089605+00
