 &amp; \\\\left|\\\\begin{array}{rr} 4 &amp; 1 \\\\\\\\ -2 &amp; -1 \\\\end{array}\\\\right| \\\\end{array}\\\\right]^{t} \\\\\\\\ =\\\\left[\\\\begin{array}{rrr} -3 &amp; -27 &amp; 11 \\\\\\\\ -11 &amp; -51 &amp; 19 \\\\\\\\ 2 &amp; 2 &amp; -2 \\\\end{array}\\\\right]^{t}=\\\\left[\\\\begin{array}{rrr} -3 &amp; -11 &amp; 2 \\\\\\\\ -27 &amp; -51 &amp; 2 \\\\\\\\ 11 &amp; 19 &amp; -2 \\\\end{array}\\\\right] \\\\\\\\ \\\\therefore A^{-1}=\\\\frac{1}{|A|} \\\\text { adj } A=\\\\frac{1}{16}\\\\left[\\\\begin{array}{rrr} -3 &amp; -11 &amp; 2 \\\\\\\\ -27 &amp; -51 &amp; 2 \\\\\\\\ 11 &amp; 19 &amp; -2 \\\\end{array}\\\\right] \\\\text { (Ans.) } \\\\\\\\ \\\\end{array} \\\\)</p>","C":"<p>বামপক্ষ \\\\( =|B|=\\\\left|\\\\begin{array}{ccc}a^{2} &amp; b c &amp; c a+c^{2} \\\\\\\\ a^{2}+a b &amp; b^{2} &amp; c a \\\\\\\\ a b &amp; b^{2}+b c &amp; c^{2}\\\\end{array}\\\\right| \\\\)</p><p>\\\\( =a b c\\\\left|\\\\begin{array}{ccc}a &amp; c &amp; a+c \\\\\\\\ a+b &amp; b &amp; a \\\\\\\\ b &amp; b+c, &amp; c\\\\end{array}\\\\right| \\\\)</p><p>\\\\( =a b c\\\\left|\\\\begin{array}{ccc}0 &amp; c &amp; a+c \\\\\\\\ 2 b &amp; b &amp; a \\\\\\\\ 2 b &amp; b+c &amp; c\\\\end{array}\\\\right|\\\\left[c_{1}^{\\\\prime}=\\\\left(c_{1}+c_{2}\\\\right)-c_{3}\\\\right. \\\\) প্রয়োগ করেে \\\\( ] \\\\)</p><p>\\\\( \\\\begin{array}{l}=2 b \\\\times a b c\\\\left|\\\\begin{array}{ccc}0 &amp; c &amp; a+c \\\\\\\\ 1 &amp; b &amp; a \\\\\\\\ 1 &amp; b+c &amp; c\\\\end{array}\\\\right| \\\\\\\\ =2 a b^{2} c\\\\left|\\\\begin{array}{ccc}0 &amp; c &amp; a+c \\\\\\\\ 0 &amp; -c &amp; a-c \\\\\\\\ 1 &amp; b+c &amp; c\\\\end{array}\\\\right| \\\\quad\\\\left[r_{2}^{\\\\prime}=r_{2}-r_{3} \\\\text { প্রয়োগ করে] }\\\\right. \\\\\\\\ =2 a b^{2} c\\\\left|\\\\begin{array}{cc}c &amp; a+c \\\\\\\\ -c &amp; a-c\\\\end{array}\\\\right| \\\\text { (১ম কলাম সাপেক্ষে বিস্তার করে) } \\\\\\\\ =2 a b^{2} c^{2}\\\\left|\\\\begin{array}{cc}1 &amp; a+c \\\\\\\\ -1 &amp; a-c\\\\end{array}\\\\right|=2 a b^{2} c^{2}(