01a102ac-ca61-7059-920e-5391f819cfe8	\N	written	<p>\\( 2 x-y=3 \\ldots \\ldots \\ldots \\) (i)</p><p>\\( x^{2}+y^{2}-8 x-16 y-8=0 \\ldots \\ldots \\).(ii)</p>	\N	{"A":"<p><span>প্রদত্ত বৃত্তের সমীকরণ,</span></p><p><span>3(x²+y²)-6x+3y+1=0</span></p><p>\\\\( \\\\therefore \\\\) \\\\( x^{2}+y^{2}-2 x+y+\\\\frac{1}{3}=0 \\\\)</p><p>\\\\( \\\\therefore \\\\) <span>কেন্দ্রের স্থানাঙ্ক </span>\\\\( \\\\left(1,-\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\right) \\\\)</p><p><span>এবং ব্যাসার্ধ </span>\\\\( =\\\\sqrt{1^{2}+\\\\left(-\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\right)^{2}-\\\\frac{1}{3}}=\\\\sqrt{1+\\\\frac{1}{4}-\\\\frac{1}{3}} \\\\)</p><p>\\\\( =\\\\sqrt{\\\\frac{11}{12}} \\\\) <span>একক (Ans.)</span></p>","B":"<p><span>ধরি, বৃত্তটির সমীকরণ,</span></p><p><span>x² + y² + 2gx + 2fy + c = 0………….(i)</span></p><p><span>বৃত্তটির কেন্দ্র (-g, -f), 2x - y = 3 সরলরেখার ওপর অবস্থিত।</span></p><p><span>সুতরাং - 2g + f = 3 </span>\\\\( \\\\therefore \\\\)<span> f = 3 + 2g…………(ii)</span></p><p><span>(i) নং (-2, 0) বিন্দুগামী।</span></p><p>\\\\( (-2)^{2}+0^{2}+2 \\\\mathrm{~g}(-2)+2 \\\\mathrm{f} .0+\\\\mathrm{c}=0 \\\\)</p><p><span>বা, 4 - 4g + c = 0</span><br />\\\\( \\\\therefore \\\\) <span>c = 4g - 4…….(iii)</span></p><p><span>(i) নং (3,-2) বিন্দুগামী।</span></p><p>\\\\( 3^{2}+(-2)^{2}+2 g(3)+2 f(-2)+c=0 \\\\)</p><p><span>বা, 13 + 6g -4(3+2g) + 4g - 4 = 0 [(ii) ও (iii) নং হতে)</span></p><p><span>বা, 2g - 3 = 0 </span>\\\\( \\\\therefore g=\\\\frac{3}{2} \\\\)</p><p><span>g এর মান (ii) নং এ বসিয়ে পাই,</span></p><p>\\\\( f=3+2\\\\left(\\\\frac{3}{2}\\\\right)=3+3=6 \\\\)</p><p><span>g এর মান (iii) নং এ বসিয়ে পাই,</span></p><p>\\\\( c=4\\\\left(\\\\frac{3}{2}\\\\right)-4=6-4=2 \\\\)</p><p><span>g, f ও c এর মান (i) নং এ বসিয়ে পাই,</span></p><p>\\\\( \\\\begin{array}{l}\\\\mathrm{x}^{2}+\\\\mathrm{y}^{2}+2\\\\left(\\\\frac{3}{2}\\\\right) \\\\mathrm{x}+2(6) \\\\mathrm{y}+2=0 \\\\\\\\ \\\\therefore \\\\mathrm{x}^{2}+\\\\mathrm{y}^{2}+3 \\\\mathrm{x}+12 \\\\mathrm{y}+2=0 \\\\text { (Ans.) }\\\\end{array} \\\\)</p>","C":"<p>প