01a102b0-3460-74f1-8a90-b6e820989ba5	01a101fc-a005-7517-bc3f-4cd15fbe15c1	mcq	<p>\\(\\cos^230°+\\cos^260°+........+\\cos^2180°\\)এর মান-</p>	\N	<p>\\( \\cos ^{2} 30^{\\circ}+\\cos ^{2} 60^{\\circ}+\\cos ^{2} 90^{\\circ}+\\cos ^{2} 120^{\\circ}+\\cos ^{2} 150^{\\circ}+\\cos ^{2} 180^{\\circ} \\)</p><p></p><p>প্রথমে, প্রতিটি কোণের কোসাইন মান নির্ণয় করি:</p><p></p><p>\\( \\begin{array}{c} \\cos 30^{\\circ}=\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}, \\quad \\cos 60^{\\circ}=\\frac{1}{2}, \\quad \\cos 90^{\\circ}=0 \\\\ \\cos 120^{\\circ}=-\\frac{1}{2}, \\quad \\cos 150^{\\circ}=-\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}, \\quad \\cos 180^{\\circ}=-1 \\end{array} \\)</p><p></p><p>এখন, প্রতিটি কোসাইন মানের বর্গ নির্ণয় করি:</p><p></p><p>\\( \\begin{array}{c} \\cos ^{2} 30^{\\circ}=\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}\\right)^{2}=\\frac{3}{4} \\\\ \\cos ^{2} 60^{\\circ}=\\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right)^{2}=\\frac{1}{4} \\\\ \\cos ^{2} 90^{\\circ}=0^{2}=0 \\\\ \\cos ^{2} 120^{\\circ}=\\left(-\\frac{1}{2}\\right)^{2}=\\frac{1}{4} \\\\ \\cos ^{2} 150^{\\circ}=\\left(-\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}\\right)^{2}=\\frac{3}{4} \\end{array} \\)</p><p></p><p>\\( \\begin{array}{c} \\cos ^{2} 150^{\\circ}=\\left(-\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}\\right)^{2}=\\frac{3}{4} \\\\ \\cos ^{2} 180^{\\circ}=(-1)^{2}=1 \\end{array} \\)</p><p></p><p>এখন, এই মানগুলি যোগ করি:</p><p></p><p>\\( \\frac{3}{4}+\\frac{1}{4}+0+\\frac{1}{4}+\\frac{3}{4}+1=\\frac{3+1+0+1+3+4}{4}=\\frac{12}{4}=3 \\)</p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p>\\( \\cos ^{2} 30^{\\circ}+\\cos ^{2} 60^{\\circ}+\\cos ^{2} 90^{\\circ}+\\cos ^{2} 120^{\\circ}+\\cos ^{2} 150^{\\circ}+\\cos ^{2} 180^{\\circ}=3 \\)</p>	published	\N	64	2026-10-03 16:54:24.665114+00	2026-10-03 16:54:24.665114+00
