01a102ee-0735-73e3-8c47-0e9ad9d035bf	\N	mcq	<p>One of the _____ of globalization is cultural _____.</p>	\N	<p>One of the' এর পরে noun টি plural form এ হবে । Cultural assault অর্থ সংস্কৃতিগত আঘাত বা আগ্রাসন ।</p><p><br />The correct pair to complete the sentence is "effects, assault."</p><p>The complete sentence would be: "One of the effects of globalization is cultural assault."</p><p>Explanation:</p><ol><li><p><strong>Effect, Shock:</strong> While "effect" is appropriate, "shock" might not be the best match for "cultural." "Shock" implies a sudden and intense impact, and it may not capture the nuanced impact of globalization on culture.</p></li><li><p><strong>Affects, Surprise:</strong> "Affects" is a verb, and it doesn't match with "one of the" in the context of the sentence. "Surprise" also does not convey the complexity of the impact.</p></li><li><p><strong>Effects, Assault:</strong> This is the correct pair. "Effects" appropriately describes the outcomes or consequences of globalization, and "assault" is used metaphorically to convey a forceful and potentially harmful impact on culture.</p></li><li><p><strong>Effect, Confusion:</strong> While "effect" is suitable, "confusion" may not fully capture the multifaceted nature of the impact of globalization on culture.</p></li></ol><p>In summary, "effects, assault" provides a more accurate and nuanced representation of the impact of globalization on culture, conveying the idea of forceful and potentially harmful consequences.</p>	published	\N	56	2026-10-03 18:01:56.337567+00	2026-10-03 18:01:56.337567+00
