01a10302-558b-734c-8c10-eaf6226dce66	\N	written	<p>Write a paragraph on ‘How education can enlighten one's life'.</p>	\N	<p>Education has the power to illuminate one's life in profound ways. It opens doors to new knowledge,  broadens perspectives, and cultivates ability for critical thinking. Through learning, individuals gain the tools to understand complex ideas, solve problems, and make informed decisions. Education empowers people to pursue their passions, helps them to advance in their careers, and contributes meaningfully to society. Besides, it fosters personal growth, enhances self-confidence, and promotes lifelong curiosity. Moreover, education connects us to diverse cultures and ideas by fostering empathy and global awareness. Education provides access to a vast body of knowledge, enabling individuals to grasp complex ideas, understand different perspectives. By encouraging critical analysis and problem-solving, education empowers individuals to question assumptions, evaluate information, and make informed decisions, rather than blindly accepting what they are told. Education fosters self-awareness, expands one's horizons, and helps individuals discover their passions and talents, leading to greater self-confidence and a sense of purpose. Education promotes empathy, understanding of diverse cultures, and civic responsibility. Education cultivates a love of learning and a desire to continue growing and expanding one's knowledge throughout life, making it a powerful tool for personal and societal progress. Ultimately, education fosters a deeper understanding of oneself and the world, leading to a more fulfilling and purposeful life. Thus Education develops our way of life.</p>	published	\N	2	2026-10-03 18:24:07.115735+00	2026-10-03 18:24:07.115735+00
