01a10265-8883-75db-9f1d-b7f652d7a9ee	01a101fc-a002-7141-81c1-0e4eb8156f18	mcq	<p>ভেক্টর\\(\\overrightarrow{u}=2\\hat{i}+\\hat{j}-3\\hat{k}\\)ও\\(\\overrightarrow{v}=3\\hat{i}-2\\hat{j}-\\hat{k}\\)এর অন্তর্ভুক্ত কোণ–</p>	\N	<p>দুটি ভেক্টরের ডট গুণন হলো:</p><p>\\(\\vec{u} \\cdot \\vec{v} = (2\\hat{i} + \\hat{j} - 3\\hat{k}) \\cdot (3\\hat{i} - 2\\hat{j} - \\hat{k})\\)</p><p>\\(\\vec{u} \\cdot \\vec{v} = (2)(3) + (1)(-2) + (-3)(-1)\\)</p><p>\\(\\vec{u} \\cdot \\vec{v} = 6 - 2 + 3\\)</p><p>\\(\\vec{u} \\cdot \\vec{v} = 7\\)</p><p>\n\n</p><p></p><p>ভেক্টর \\(\\vec{u}\\) এর মান:</p><p>\\(|\\vec{u}| = \\sqrt{2^2 + 1^2 + (-3)^2}\\)</p><p>\\(|\\vec{u}| = \\sqrt{4 + 1 + 9}\\)</p><p>\\(|\\vec{u}| = \\sqrt{14}\\)</p><p>\n\n</p><p>ভেক্টর \\(\\vec{v}\\) এর মান:</p><p>\\(|\\vec{v}| = \\sqrt{3^2 + (-2)^2 + (-1)^2}\\)</p><p>\\(|\\vec{v}| = \\sqrt{9 + 4 + 1}\\)</p><p>\\(|\\vec{v}| = \\sqrt{14}\\)</p><p>\n\n</p><p></p><p>দুটি ভেক্টরের মধ্যবর্তী কোণ \\(\\theta\\) নির্ণয়ের সূত্রটি হলো:</p><p>\\(\\cos \\theta = \\frac{\\vec{u} \\cdot \\vec{v}}{|\\vec{u}| |\\vec{v}|}\\)</p><p>মানগুলো বসিয়ে পাই:</p><p>\\(\\cos \\theta = \\frac{7}{\\sqrt{14} \\cdot \\sqrt{14}}\\)</p><p>\\(\\cos \\theta = \\frac{7}{14}\\)</p><p>\\(\\cos \\theta = \\frac{1}{2}\\)</p><p>\\(\\theta = \\cos^{-1}\\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right)\\)</p><p>\\(\\theta = 60^{\\circ}\\)</p>	published	\N	62	2026-10-03 15:32:50.999034+00	2026-10-03 15:32:50.999034+00
