01a1031f-68d0-7412-b358-b772bd55a61e	\N	written	<p>Write a paragraph by analyzing the significance of Bangabandhu Sheikh Mujibur Rahman's historical speech of 7th March 1971.</p>	\N	<p>Bangabandhu Sheikh Mujibur Rahman on March 7 reshaped the history of Bangladesh through the speech. The people of the country had got the final directive on how they should act with the autocratic Pakistani junta.</p><p>  </p><p>The vigorous speech of Bangabandhu encouraged our people to prepare for the War of Independence. On this day, Bangabandhu proclaimed in a thunderous voice at a large public gathering at the Race Course Madina (now Suhrawary Udyan) in Dhaka. 'The struggle this time is a struggle for freedom. the struggle this time is a struggle for emancipation.' This line inspired the Bengalese to fight and achieve sovereignty.</p>	published	\N	4	2026-10-03 18:55:52.579271+00	2026-10-03 18:55:52.579271+00
