01a10325-9d37-713e-8462-2a38dfa766c3	\N	mcq	<p>Which one is the correct passive voice of "Who will help you"?</p>	\N	<p><strong>Active Voice:</strong> <strong>"Who will help you?"</strong><br />🔹 <strong>(তোমাকে সাহায্য করবে কে?)</strong></p><p><strong>Passive Voice Structure:</strong><br />👉 <strong>"By whom + will + subject + be + past participle?"</strong></p><p>📌 <strong>Passive: "By whom will you be helped?"</strong><br />🔹 <strong>(তোমাকে কার দ্বারা সাহায্য করা হবে?)</strong></p><p></p><h3><strong>🔹 Structure Breakdown:</strong></h3><table><tbody><tr><th colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><strong>Active Voice</strong></p></th><th colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><strong>Passive Voice</strong></p></th></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><strong>Who</strong> (subject)</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><strong>By whom</strong> (agent)</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><strong>will</strong> (modal verb)</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><strong>will</strong> (modal verb)</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><strong>help</strong> (verb)</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><strong>be helped</strong> (passive)</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><strong>you</strong> (object)</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><strong>you</strong> (subject)</p></td></tr></tbody></table>	published	\N	75	2026-10-03 19:02:39.211989+00	2026-10-03 19:02:39.211989+00
