01a10288-fc10-777b-af71-e08bc81e4709	01a101fc-a005-7517-bc40-404a9b5bf6cc	mcq	<p>7x<sup>2</sup>-5x-3=0 সমীকরণের মূলদ্বয়   \\( \\alpha , \\beta \\)   হলে এরুপ এবং অখন্ড সহগবিশিষ্ট সমীকরণ গঠন করা যার মূল   \\( \\frac{1}{\\alpha} + \\frac{3}{\\beta} , \\frac{3}{\\alpha} + \\frac{1}{\\beta} \\)   হবে । </p>	\N	<p>প্রদত্ত সমীকরণ:</p><p>\\(7x^2 - 5x - 3 = 0\\)</p><p>মূলদ্বয় \\(\\alpha, \\beta\\)।</p><p>ভিয়েটার সূত্র থেকে:</p><p>\\(\\alpha + \\beta = \\frac{5}{7}, \\alpha\\beta = -\\frac{3}{7}\\)</p><p></p><p>নতুন মূল:</p><p>\\(m = \\frac{1}{\\alpha} + \\frac{3}{\\beta} = \\frac{\\beta + 3\\alpha}{\\alpha\\beta}\\)</p><p>\\(n = \\frac{3}{\\alpha} + \\frac{1}{\\beta} = \\frac{3\\beta + \\alpha}{\\alpha\\beta}\\)</p><p></p><p>\\(m+n\\)</p><p>\\(m+n = \\frac{\\beta + 3\\alpha + 3\\beta + \\alpha}{\\alpha\\beta} = \\frac{4\\alpha + 4\\beta}{\\alpha\\beta} = \\frac{4(\\alpha + \\beta)}{\\alpha\\beta}\\)</p><p></p><p></p><p>\\( = \\frac{4 \\cdot \\frac{5}{7}}{-\\frac{3}{7}} = \\frac{20/7}{-3/7} = -\\frac{20}{3} \\)</p><p></p><p>mn</p><p>\\( mn = \\left(\\frac{\\beta + 3\\alpha}{\\alpha\\beta}\\right)\\left(\\frac{3\\beta + \\alpha}{\\alpha\\beta}\\right) = \\frac{(\\beta + 3\\alpha)(3\\beta + \\alpha)}{(\\alpha\\beta)^2} \\)</p><p></p><p>লব:</p><p>\\( (\\beta + 3\\alpha)(3\\beta + \\alpha) = 3\\beta^2 + \\alpha\\beta + 9\\alpha\\beta + 3\\alpha^2 \\)</p><p>\\( = 3(\\alpha^2 + \\beta^2) + 10\\alpha\\beta \\)</p><p>\\( \\alpha^2 + \\beta^2 = (\\alpha + \\beta)^2 - 2\\alpha\\beta = \\frac{25}{49} - 2\\left(-\\frac{3}{7}\\right) \\)</p><p>\\( = \\frac{25}{49} + \\frac{6}{7} = \\frac{25}{49} + \\frac{42}{49} = \\frac{67}{49} \\)</p><p></p><p>তাহলে:</p><p>\\( 3(\\alpha^2 + \\beta^2) + 10\\alpha\\beta = 3 \\cdot \\frac{67}{49} + 10 \\cdot \\left(-\\frac{3}{7}\\right) \\)</p><p></p><p>\\( = \\frac{201}{49} - \\frac{30}{7} = \\frac{201}{49} - \\frac{210}{49} = -\\frac{9}{49} \\)</p><p>এখন:</p><p>\\( mn = \\frac{-9/49}{(\\alpha\\beta)^2} = \\frac{-9/49}{(-\\frac{3}{7})^2} = \\frac{-9/49}{9/49} = -1 \\)</p><p>৩. নতুন সমীকরণ</p><p>\\( x^2 - (m+n)x + mn = 0 \\)</p><p>\\( x^2 - \\left(-\\frac{20}{3}\\right)x + (-1) = 0 \\)</p><p>\\( x^2 + \\frac{20}{3}x - 1 = 0 \\)</p><p>\\( 3x^2 + 20x - 3 = 0 \\)</p>	published	\N	92	2026-10-03 16:11:34.342009+00	2026-10-03 16:11:34.342009+00
