01a10330-add3-75a2-977e-2cf855a654ec	\N	mcq	<p>Choose the alternatives that best replace the underlined portions of the following sentence <br />It was <strong><em>us who had left before he arrived.</em></strong></p>	\N	<p>✅ <strong>সঠিক উত্তর:</strong> <strong>(খ) we who had left before he arrived</strong></p><h3><strong>ব্যাখ্যা:</strong></h3><p>🔹 <strong>It was + subject pronoun (we, he, she)</strong> হয়।<br />🔹 <strong>"who"</strong> একটি subject pronoun, তাই <strong>"we"</strong> হবে <strong>"us"</strong> নয়।<br />🔹 <strong>"had left"</strong> সঠিক past perfect tense, কিন্তু <strong>"had went"</strong> ভুল (কারণ <strong>"went"</strong> কখনোই past participle হয় না, <strong>"gone"</strong> হয়)।</p><h3><strong>ভুল উত্তরগুলোর বিশ্লেষণ:</strong></h3><p>❌ <strong>(ক) us who had left before he arrived</strong><br />🔹 <strong>ভুল:</strong> "us" object pronoun, কিন্তু এখানে subject pronoun <strong>"we"</strong> দরকার।</p><p>❌ <strong>(গ) we who had went before he arrived</strong><br />🔹 <strong>ভুল:</strong> <strong>"had went"</strong> ভুল, কারণ <strong>"went"</strong> simple past tense, কিন্তু <strong>"had + V3"</strong> দরকার, যা <strong>"had gone"</strong> হবে।</p><p>❌ <strong>(ঘ) us who had went before he arrived</strong><br />🔹 <strong>ভুল:</strong> <strong>"us"</strong> object pronoun এবং <strong>"had went"</strong> ভুল tense।</p>	published	\N	28	2026-10-03 19:14:44.362228+00	2026-10-03 19:14:44.362228+00
