01a10290-23bc-7671-9951-bc999a1ffc75	01a101fc-a005-7517-bc3c-a2444ca9fd2f	written	<p>\\( A=\\left[\\begin{array}{rrr} 4 &amp; 1 &amp; 5 \\\\ -2 &amp; -1 &amp; -3 \\\\ 3 &amp; -4 &amp; -9 \\end{array}\\right], B=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc} a^{2} &amp; b c &amp; c a+c^{2} \\\\ a^{2}+a b &amp; b^{2} &amp; c a \\\\ a b &amp; b^{2}+b c &amp; c^{2} \\end{array}\\right] \\)</p>	\N	{"A":"<p><span>আমরা জানি, কোনো ম্যাট্রিক্স বক্র-প্রতিসম হলে তার মূখ্য কর্ণ বরাবর ভূক্তিগুলো 0 এবং অন্য যেকোন ভূক্তির জন্য</span> \\\\( a_{\\\\mathrm{ij}}=-\\\\mathrm{a}_{\\\\mathrm{j} i} \\\\) হয়।</p><p>\\\\( \\\\begin{array}{l} \\\\therefore c=2 c=c=0 \\\\\\\\ \\\\text { এবং } a_{31}=b=-a_{13}=-6\\\\left[\\\\because \\\\mathrm{a}_{13}=-6\\\\right] \\\\\\\\ \\\\therefore b=6 \\\\\\\\ \\\\therefore c+b=0+(6)=6 \\\\text { (Ans.) } \\\\end{array} \\\\)</p>","B":"<p><span>দেওয়া আছে</span>, \\\\( \\\\mathrm{A}=\\\\left[\\\\begin{array}{rrr}4 &amp; 1 &amp; 5 \\\\\\\\ -2 &amp; -1 &amp; -3 \\\\\\\\ 3 &amp; -4 &amp; -9\\\\end{array}\\\\right] \\\\) </p><p>\\\\( |A|=4(9-12)-1(18+9)+5(8+3)=16 \\\\neq 0 \\\\) </p><p>\\\\( \\\\therefore \\\\mathrm{A}^{-1} \\\\) <span>নির্ণয়যোগ্য</span>। </p><p>\\\\( \\\\begin{array}{l} \\\\operatorname{adj} A=\\\\left[\\\\begin{array}{rrr} \\\\left|\\\\begin{array}{rr} -1 &amp; -3 \\\\\\\\ -4 &amp; -9 \\\\end{array}\\\\right| &amp; -\\\\left|\\\\begin{array}{rr} -2 &amp; -3 \\\\\\\\ 3 &amp; -9 \\\\end{array}\\\\right| &amp; \\\\left|\\\\begin{array}{rr} -2 &amp; -1 \\\\\\\\ 3 &amp; -4 \\\\end{array}\\\\right| \\\\\\\\ -\\\\left|\\\\begin{array}{rr} r &amp; 5 \\\\\\\\ -4 &amp; -9 \\\\end{array}\\\\right| &amp; \\\\left|\\\\begin{array}{rr} 4 &amp; 5 \\\\\\\\ 3 &amp; -9 \\\\end{array}\\\\right| &amp; -\\\\left|\\\\begin{array}{rr} 4 &amp; 1 \\\\\\\\ 3 &amp; -4 \\\\end{array}\\\\right| \\\\\\\\ \\\\qquad\\\\left|\\\\begin{array}{rr} 1 &amp; 5 \\\\\\\\ -1 &amp; -3 \\\\end{array}\\\\right| &amp; -\\\\left|\\\\begin{array}{rr} 4 &amp; 5 \\\\\\\\ -2 &amp; -3 \\\\end{array}\\\\right|