a-c+a+c) \\\\text { } \\\\\\\\ =2 a b^{2} c^{2}(2 a)=4 a^{2} b^{2} c^{2} \\\\\\\\ \\\\therefore|\\\\mathrm{B}|=4 \\\\mathrm{a}^{2} \\\\mathrm{~b}^{2} \\\\mathrm{c}^{2} \\\\text { (প্রমাণিত) } \\\\\\\\\\\\end{array} \\\\)</p>"}	published	\N	87	2026-10-03 16:19:23.25086+00	2026-10-04 03:40:18+00
01a102b6-7a8c-7026-99a3-779a63e9cd32	01a101fc-a005-7517-bc3f-ad8c63a6edb3	written	<p>\\( y=\\ln \\left(x+\\sqrt{m^{2}+x^{2}}\\right) \\) এবং \\( h(x)=\\frac{x}{\\ln x} \\)</p>	\N	{"A":"<p>দেওয়া আছে, \\\\( y=c x(2+x)=2 c x+c x^{2} \\\\) </p><p>\\\\( \\\\therefore \\\\frac{\\\\mathrm{dy}}{\\\\mathrm{dx}}=.2 \\\\mathrm{c}+2 \\\\mathrm{cx} \\\\)  </p><p><span>মূলবিন্দুতে ঢাল</span>, \\\\( \\\\left.\\\\frac{\\\\mathrm{dy}}{\\\\mathrm{dx}}\\\\right|_{(0,0)}=2 \\\\mathrm{c}+2 \\\\mathrm{c} .0=2 \\\\mathrm{c} \\\\) </p><p><span>শর্তমতে</span>, \\\\( 2 c=\\\\tan 60^{\\\\circ}=\\\\sqrt{3} \\\\quad \\\\therefore c=\\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{3}}{2} \\\\) (Ans.)</p>","B":"<p>দেওয়া আছে, \\\\( y=\\\\ln \\\\left(x+\\\\sqrt{m^{2}+x^{2}}\\\\right) \\\\) </p><p>বা, \\\\( y_{1}=\\\\frac{1}{x+\\\\sqrt{m^{2}+x^{2}}}\\\\left(1+\\\\frac{1}{2 \\\\sqrt{m^{2}+x^{2}}} 2 x\\\\right) \\\\) </p><p>বা, \\\\( y_{1}=\\\\frac{1}{x+\\\\sqrt{m^{2}+x^{2}}} \\\\times \\\\frac{x+\\\\sqrt{m^{2}+x^{2}}}{\\\\sqrt{m^{2}+x^{2}}} \\\\) </p><p>বা, \\\\( \\\\sqrt{\\\\mathrm{m}^{2}+\\\\mathrm{x}^{2}} \\\\cdot \\\\mathrm{y}_{1}=1 \\\\) </p><p>বা, \\\\( \\\\left(m^{2}+x^{2}\\\\right) y_{1}{ }^{2}=1 \\\\), [উভয় পক্ষকে বর্গ করে] </p><p>বা, \\\\( \\\\left(m^{2}+x^{2}\\\\right) 2 y_{1} y_{2}+2 x y_{1}{ }^{2}=0 \\\\) </p><p>\\\\( \\\\therefore\\\\left(\\\\mathrm{m}^{2}+\\\\mathrm{x}^{2}\\\\right) \\\\mathrm{y}_{2}+\\\\mathrm{xy}_{1}=0 \\\\) (প্রমাণিত)</p>","C":"<p>অনুরূপ।</p><p><span>প্রদত্ত রাশি</span> \\\\( =\\\\frac{e^{F(x)}}{F(x)}=\\\\frac{e^{\\\\ln x}}{\\\\ln x}=\\\\frac{x}{\\\\ln x} \\\\quad \\\\operatorname{} \\\\) </p><p><span>মনে করি</span>, \\\\( f(x)=y=\\\\frac{x}{\\\\ln x} \\\\therefore \\\\frac{d y}{d x}=\\\\frac{\\\\ln x \\\\cdot 1-x \\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{x}}{(\\\\ln x)^{2}}=\\\\frac{\\\\ln x-1}{(\\\\ln x)^{2}} \\\\) </p><p><span>এবং</span> \\\\( \\\\frac{\\\\mathrm{d}^{2} \\\\mathrm{y}}{\\\\mathrm{dx}}=\\\\frac{(\\\\ln x)^{2} \\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{x}-(\\\\ln x-1) \\\\ 2 \\\\ln x \\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{x}}{(\\\\ln x)^{4}} \\\\) </p><p>\\\\( =\\\\frac{\\\\frac{\\\\ln x}{x}(\\\\ln x-2 \\\\ln x+2)}{(\\\\ln x)^{4}}=\\\\frac{2-\\\\ln x}{x(\\\\ln x)^{3}} \\\\)  </p><p><span>সর্বোচ্চ ও সর্বনিম্ন মানের জন্য</span>, \\\\( \\\\frac{d y}{d x}=0 \\\\) </p><p>বা, \\\\( \\\\frac{\\\\ln x-1}{(\\\\ln x)^{2}}=0 \\\\) বা, \\\\( \\\\ln x-1=0 \\\\) বা, \\\\( \\\\ln x=1=\\\\ln e \\\\quad \\\\therefore x=e \\\\) </p><p>\\\\( \\\\mathrm{x}=\\\\mathrm{e} \\\\) হলে, \\\\( \\\\frac{\\\\mathrm{d}^{2} \\\\mathrm{y}}{\\\\mathrm{dx}}=\\\\frac{2-\\\\ln \\\\mathrm{e}}{\\\\mathrm{e}(\\\\ln \\\\mathrm{e})^{3}}=\\\\frac{2-1}{\\\\mathrm{e} \\\\cdot 1^{3}}=\\\\frac{1}{\\\\mathrm{e}}&gt;0 \\\\) </p><p><span>সুতরাং </span>\\\\(x=e\\\\)<span> বিন্দুতে </span>\\\\(f(x)\\\\)<span> ফাংশনটির ক্ষুদ্রতম মান বিদ্যমান।</span></p><p>\\\\( \\\\therefore \\\\) <span>ফাংশনটির ক্ষুদ্রতম মান</span> \\\\( =\\\\mathrm{f}(\\\\mathrm{e})=\\\\frac{\\\\mathrm{e}}{\\\\ln \\\\mathrm{e}}=\\\\frac{\\\\mathrm{e}}{1}=\\\\mathrm{e} \\\\) (Ans.)</p>"}	published	\N	75	2026-10-03 17:01:15.839972+00	2026-10-04 03:40:24.898+00
01a102d0-3950-7683-9c13-6a935aa5e4fa	\N	written	<p>\\( 2 x-y=3 \\ldots \\ldots \\ldots \\) (i)</p><p>\\( x^{2}+y^{2}-8 x-16 y-8=0 \\ldots \\ldots \\).(ii)</p>	\N	{"A":"<p><span>প্রদত্ত বৃত্তের সমীকরণ,</span></p><p><span>3(x²+y²)-6x+3y+1=0</span></p><p>\\\\( \\\\therefore \\\\) \\\\( x^{2}+y^{2}-2 x+y+\\\\frac{1}{3}=0 \\\\)</p><p>\\\\( \\\\therefore \\\\) <span>কেন্দ্রের স্থানাঙ্ক </span>\\\\( \\\\left(1,-\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\right) \\\\)</p><p><span>এবং ব্যাসার্ধ </span>\\\\( =\\\\sqrt{1^{2}+\\\\left(-\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\right)^{2}-\\\\frac{1}{3}}=\\\\sqrt{1+\\\\frac{1}{4}-\\\\frac{1}{3}} \\\\)</p><p>\\\\( =\\\\sqrt{\\\\frac{11}{12}} \\\\) <span>একক (Ans.)</span></p>","B":"<p><span>ধরি, বৃত্তটির সমীকরণ,</span></p><p><span>x² + y² + 2gx + 2fy + c = 0………….(i)</span></p><p><span>বৃত্তটির কেন্দ্র (-g, -f), 2x - y = 3 সরলরেখার ওপর অবস্থিত।</span></p><p><span>সুতরাং - 2g + f = 3 </span>\\\\( \\\\therefore \\\\)<span> f = 3 + 2g…………(ii)</span></p><p><span>(i) নং (-2, 0) বিন্দুগামী।</span></p><p>\\\\( (-2)^{2}+0^{2}+2 \\\\mathrm{~g}(-2)+2 \\\\mathrm{f} .0+\\\\mathrm{c}=0 \\\\)</p><p><span>বা, 4 - 4g + c = 0</span><br />\\\\( \\\\therefore \\\\) <span>c = 4g - 4…….(iii)</span></p><p><span>(i) নং (3,-2) বিন্দুগামী।</span></p><p>\\\\( 3^{2}+(-2)^{2}+2 g(3)+2 f(-2)+c=0 \\\\)</p><p><span>বা, 13 + 6g -4(3+2g) + 4g - 4 = 0 [(ii) ও (iii) নং হতে)</span></p><p><span>বা, 2g - 3 = 0 </span>\\\\( \\\\therefore g=\\\\frac{3}{2} \\\\)</p><p><span>g এর মান (ii) নং এ বসিয়ে পাই,</span></p><p>\\\\( f=3+2\\\\left(\\\\frac{3}{2}\\\\right)=3+3=6 \\\\)</p><p><span>g এর মান (iii) নং এ বসিয়ে পাই,</span></p><p>\\\\( c=4\\\\left(\\\\frac{3}{2}\\\\right)-4=6-4=2 \\\\)</p><p><span>g, f ও c এর মান (i) নং এ বসিয়ে পাই,</span></p><p>\\\\( \\\\begin{array}{l}\\\\mathrm{x}^{2}+\\\\mathrm{y}^{2}+2\\\\left(\\\\frac{3}{2}\\\\right) \\\\mathrm{x}+2(6) \\\\mathrm{y}+2=0 \\\\\\\\ \\\\therefore \\\\mathrm{x}^{2}+\\\\mathrm{y}^{2}+3 \\\\mathrm{x}+12 \\\\mathrm{y}+2=0 \\\\text { (Ans.) }\\\\end{array} \\\\)</p>","C":"<p>প্রদত্ত বৃত্তের সমীকরণ, x²+ y² - 8x - 16y - 8 = 0 ...... ..(i)</p><p>এবং রেখার সমীকরণ, 5x - 12y -9 = 0......(ii)</p><p>(i) নং বৃত্তের কেন্দ্রের স্থানাঙ্ক (4, 8)</p><p>এবং ব্যাসার্ধ \\\\( =\\\\sqrt{16+64+8}=\\\\sqrt{88} \\\\) একক</p><p>(ii) নং রেখার সমান্তরাল রেখার সমীকরণ,</p><p>5x - 12y + k = 0... ... ...(iii)</p><p>এখন, (iii) নং রেখাটি বৃত্তের স্পর্শক হলে, কেন্দ্র হতে রেখাটির ওপর অঙ্কিত লম্বদূরত্ব বৃত্তের ব্যাসার্ধের সমান হবে।</p><p>\\\\( \\\\begin{array}{l}\\\\therefore \\\\frac{|5.4-| 2.8+k \\\\mid}{\\\\sqrt{5^{2}+(12)^{2}}}=\\\\sqrt{88} \\\\\\\\ \\\\text { বা, } \\\\frac{|k-76|}{\\\\sqrt{25+144}}=\\\\sqrt{88} \\\\\\\\ \\\\text { বা, } \\\\frac{|k-76|}{\\\\sqrt{169}}=\\\\sqrt{88} \\\\\\\\ \\\\text { বা, } \\\\frac{k-76}{13}= \\\\pm \\\\sqrt{88} \\\\\\\\ \\\\therefore k= \\\\pm 13 \\\\sqrt{88}+76= \\\\pm 26 \\\\sqrt{22}+76\\\\end{array} \\\\)</p><p>\\\\( \\\\therefore \\\\) নির্ণেয় স্পর্শকের সমীকরণ, \\\\( 5 x-12 y \\\\pm 26 \\\\sqrt{22}+76=0 \\\\) (Ans.)</p>"}	published	\N	3	2026-10-03 17:29:23.079587+00	2026-10-04 03:40:26.473+00
