/p><p><br />#1</p><p>বা, \\\\(A X=B\\\\); যেখানে \\\\(A=\\\\left[\\\\begin{array}{ccc}p &amp; q &amp; r \\\\\\\\ p^{2} &amp; q^{2} &amp; r^{2} \\\\\\\\ p^{3}-1 &amp; q^{3}-1 &amp; r^{3}-1\\\\end{array}\\\\right], X=\\\\left[\\\\begin{array}{l}x \\\\\\\\ y \\\\\\\\ z\\\\end{array}\\\\right]\\\\)</p><p><br /></p><p>এবং \\\\(B=\\\\left[\\\\begin{array}{l}1 \\\\\\\\ a \\\\\\\\ a^{2}\\\\end{array}\\\\right]\\\\)</p><p><br /></p><p>এখানে, \\\\(p \\\\neq q \\\\neq r\\\\) এবং \\\\(\\\\operatorname{Det}(A)=0\\\\)</p><p><br /></p><p>এখন, \\\\(\\\\operatorname{Det}(A)=\\\\left|\\\\begin{array}{ccc}p &amp; q &amp; r \\\\\\\\ p^{2} &amp; q^{2} &amp; r^{2} \\\\\\\\ p^{3}-1 &amp; q^{3}-1 &amp; r^{3}-1\\\\end{array}\\\\right|\\\\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\\\( =\\\\left|\\\\begin{array}{ccc} p &amp; q &amp; r \\\\\\\\ p^{2} &amp; q^{2} &amp; r^{2} \\\\\\\\ p^{3} &amp; q^{3} &amp; r^{3} \\\\end{array}\\\\right|-\\\\left|\\\\begin{array}{ccc} p &amp; q &amp; r \\\\\\\\ p^{2} &amp; q^{2} &amp; r^{2} \\\\\\\\ 1 &amp; 1 &amp; 1 \\\\end{array}\\\\right| \\\\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\\\( =p q r\\\\left|\\\\begin{array}{ccc} 1 &amp; 1 &amp; 1 \\\\\\\\ p &amp; q &amp; r \\\\\\\\ p^{2} &amp; q^{2} &amp; r^{2} \\\\end{array}\\\\right|-\\\\left|\\\\begin{array}{ccc} 1 &amp; 1 &amp; 1 \\\\\\\\ p &amp; q &amp; r \\\\\\\\ p^{2} &amp; q^{2} &amp; r^{2} \\\\end{array}\\\\right| \\\\)</p><p><br /></p><p>[\\\\(\\\\because \\\\) পাশাপাশি দুইটি সারি বা কলাম পরিবর্তন করলে নির্ণায়কের চিহ্নের পরিবর্তন হয়]</p><p>#2<br /></p><p>\\\\( =(p q r-1)\\\\left|\\\\begin{array}{ccc} 1 &amp; 1 &amp; 1 \\\\\\\\ p &amp; q &amp; r \\\\\\\\p^{2} &amp; q^{2} &amp; r^{2}\\\\end{array}\\\\right| \\\\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\\\( =(p q r-1)\\\\left|\\\\begin{array}{ccc}0 &amp; 0 &amp; 1 \\\\\\\\p-q &amp; q-r &amp; r \\\\\\\\p^{2}-q^{2} &amp; q^{2}-r^{2} &amp; r^{2} \\\\end{array}\\\\right| \\\\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\\\( [c_{1}{ }^{\\\\prime}=c_{1}-c_{2} \\\\) এবং \\\\( c_{2}{ }^{\\\\prime}=c_{2}-c_{3} \\\\) প্রয়োগ করে]</p><p><br /></p><p>\\\\( =(p q r-1)\\\\left|\\\\begin{array}{cc} p-q &amp; q-r \\\\\\\\ p^{2}-q^{2} &amp; q^{2}-r^{2} \\\\end{array}\\\\right| \\\\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\\\( =(p q r-1)(p-q)(q-r)\\\\left|\\\\begin{array}{cc} 1 &amp; 1 \\\\\\\\ p+q &amp; q+r \\\\end{array}\\\\right| \\\\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\\\( =(p q r-1)(p-q)(q-r)(q+r-p-q) \\\\)</p><p><br />#3</p><p>\\\\( =(p q r-1)(p-q)(q-r)(r-p) \\\\)</p><p><br /></p><p>এখানে, \\\\(\\\\operatorname{Det}(A)=0\\\\)</p><p><br /></p><p>বা, \\\\( (p q r-1)(p-q)(q-r)(r-p)=0 \\\\)</p><p><br /></p><p>বা, \\\\( pqr -1=0 [\\\\because p \\\\neq q \\\\neq r] \\\\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\\\( \\\\therefore p q r=1 \\\\) (দেখানো হলো) </p><p>#4</p>","C":"<p></p><p>বি.দ্র. উদ্দীপকের বর্ণনায় l, m ও n এর কোনো তথ্য নাই, l, m ও n এর পরিবর্তে যথাক্রমে p, q ও r ধরে সমাধান করা হলো:</p><p><br /></p><p>খ-হতে প্রাপ্ত, \\\\(A=\\\\left[\\\\begin{array}{ccc}p &amp; q &amp; r \\\\\\\\ p^{2} &amp; q^{2} &amp; r^{2} \\\\\\\\ p^{3}-1 &amp; q^{3}-1 &amp; r^{3}-1\\\\end{array}\\\\right]\\\\)</p><p>#1<br /></p><p>\\\\(p=1, q=2\\\\) এবং \\\\(r=-1\\\\) হলে,</p><p><br /></p><p>\\\\( A =\\\\left[\\\\begin{array}{ccc} 1 &amp; 2 &amp; -1 \\\\\\\\ 1^{2} &amp; 2^{2} &amp; (-1)^{2} \\\\\\\\ 1^{3}-1 &amp; 2^{3}-1 &amp; (-1)^{3}-1 \\\\end{array}\\\\right] \\\\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\\\( =\\\\left[\\\\begin{array}{ccc} 1 &amp; 2 &amp; -1 \\\\\\\\ 1 &amp; 4 &amp; 1 \\\\\\\\ 1-1 &amp; 8-1 &amp; -1-1 \\\\end{array}\\\\right]=\\\\left[\\\\begin{array}{rrr} 1 &amp; 2 &amp; -1 \\\\\\\\ 1 &amp; 4 &amp; 1 \\\\\\\\ 0 &amp; 7 &amp; -2 \\\\end{array}\\\\right] \\\\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\\\( \\\\therefore|A| =\\\\left[\\\\begin{array}{rrr} 1 &amp; 2 &amp; -1 \\\\\\\\ 1 &amp; 4 &amp; 1 \\\\\\\\ 0 &amp; 7 &amp; -2 \\\\end{array} \\\\mid\\\\right. \\\\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\\\( =1(-8-7)-2(-2-0)-1(7-0) \\\\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\\\( =-15+4-7=4-22=-18 \\\\neq 0 \\\\)</p><p><br />#2</p><p>\\\\(A\\\\) এর সহগুণকসমূহ :</p><p><br /></p><p>\\\\( A_{11}=\\\\left|\\\\begin{array}{rr} 4 &amp; 1 \\\\\\\\ 7 &amp; -2 \\\\end{array}\\\\right| \\\\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\\\(=-8-7=-15 \\\\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\\\( A_{12}=-\\\\left|\\\\begin{array}{rr} 1 &amp; 1 \\\\\\\\ 0 &amp; -2 \\\\end{array}\\\\right| \\\\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\\\( =-(-2-0)=2 \\\\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\\\( A_{13}=\\\\left|\\\\begin{array}{ll} 1 &amp; 4 \\\\\\\\ 0 &amp; 7 \\\\end{array}\\\\right| \\\\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\\\( =7-0=7\\\\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\\\( A_{21}=-\\\\left|\\\\begin{array}{ll} 2 &amp; -1 \\\\\\\\ 7 &amp; -2 \\\\end{array}\\\\right|\\\\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\\\( =-(-4+7)=-3 \\\\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\\\( A_{22}=\\\\left|\\\\begin{array}{ll} 1 &amp; -1 \\\\\\\\ 0 &amp; -2 \\\\end{array}\\\\right| \\\\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\\\( =-2+0=-2 \\\\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\\\( A_{23}=-\\\\left|\\\\begin{array}{ll} 1 &amp; 2 \\\\\\\\ 0 &amp; 7 \\\\end{array}\\\\right| \\\\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\\\( =-(7-0)=-7 \\\\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\\\( A_{31}=\\\\left|\\\\begin{array}{rr} 2 &amp; -1 \\\\\\\\ 4 &amp; 1 \\\\end{array}\\\\right| \\\\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\\\( =2+4=6 \\\\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\\\( A_{32}=-\\\\left|\\\\begin{array}{rr} 1 &amp; -1 \\\\\\\\ 1 &amp; 1 \\\\end{array}\\\\right| \\\\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\\\( =-(1+1)=-2 \\\\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\\\( A_{33}=\\\\left|\\\\begin{array}{ll} 1 &amp; 2 \\\\\\\\ 1 &amp; 4 \\\\end{array}\\\\right| \\\\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\\\(=4-2=2 \\\\)</p><p>#3<br /></p><p>\\\\( \\\\therefore \\\\operatorname{Adj} A=\\\\left[\\\\begin{array}{lll} \\\\mathrm{A}_{11} &amp; \\\\mathrm{~A}_{12} &amp; \\\\mathrm{~A}_{13} \\\\\\\\ \\\\mathrm{~A}_{21} &amp; \\\\mathrm{~A}_{22} &amp; \\\\mathrm{~A}_{23} \\\\\\\\ \\\\mathrm{~A}_{31} &amp; \\\\mathrm{~A}_{32} &amp; \\\\mathrm{~A}_{33} \\\\end{array}\\\\right]^{\\\\mathrm{T}} \\\\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\\\( =\\\\left[\\\\begin{array}{rrr} -15 &amp; 2 &amp; 7 \\\\\\\\ -3 &amp; -2 &amp; -7 \\\\\\\\ 6 &amp; -2 &amp; 2 \\\\end{array}\\\\right]^{T}=\\\\left[\\\\begin{array}{rr} -15 &amp; -3 \\\\\\\\ 2 &amp; -2 \\\\\\\\ 7 &amp; -7 \\\\end{array}\\\\right. \\\\)</p><p>\\\\( \\\\left.\\\\begin{array}{r} 6 \\\\\\\\ -2 \\\\\\\\ 2 \\\\end{array}\\\\right] \\\\)</p><p><br /></p><p>\\\\( A^{-1}=\\\\frac{1}{|A|} \\\\operatorname{Adj} A=\\\\frac{1}{-18}\\\\left[\\\\begin{array}{rrr} -15 &amp; -3 &amp; 6 \\\\\\\\ 2 &amp; -2 &amp; -2 \\\\\\\\ 7 &amp; -7 &amp; 2 \\\\end{array}\\\\right]=\\\\frac{1}{18}\\\\left[\\\\begin{array}{rrr} 15 &amp; 3 &amp; -6 \\\\\\\\ -2 &amp; 2 &amp; 2 \\\\\\\\ -7 &amp; 7 &amp; -2 \\\\end{array}\\\\right] \\\\)</p><p><br /></p><p>নির্ণেয় \\\\( \\\\mathrm{A}^{-1}=\\\\frac{1}{18}\\\\left[\\\\begin{array}{rrr} 15 &amp; 3 &amp; -6 \\\\\\\\ -2 &amp; 2 &amp; 2 \\\\\\\\ -7 &amp; 7 &amp; -2 \\\\end{array}\\\\right] \\\\)</p><p>#4</p>","D":""}	published	\N	136	2026-10-03 16:14:16.920869+00	2026-10-03 16:14:16.920869+00
01a102c0-65b7-7577-ac4c-cbf26e875bef	01a101fc-a002-7141-81c1-16a51aabbf29	mcq	<p>যদি \\( \\vec{A}=\\hat{i}+\\hat{j}+\\hat{k}, \\vec{B}=2 \\hat{i}+2 \\hat{j}+2 \\hat{k} \\) হয়, তবে \\( \\vec{A} \\times \\vec{B}= \\) ?</p>	\N	<p>\\( \\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{A}} \\times \\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{B}}=\\left|\\begin{array}{ccc}\\hat{\\mathrm{i}} &amp; \\hat{\\mathrm{j}} &amp; \\hat{\\mathrm{k}} \\\\ \\mathbf{1} &amp; 1 &amp; 1 \\\\ 2 &amp; 2 &amp; 2\\end{array}\\right|=\\hat{\\mathrm{i}}(2-2)+\\hat{\\mathrm{j}}(2-2)+\\hat{\\mathrm{k}}(2-2)=0 \\)</p>	published	\N	1	2026-10-03 17:12:05.878446+00	2026-10-03 17:12:05.878446+00
