01a1029f-cb24-74ac-8d9c-8362283315bd	01a101fc-a005-7517-bc40-45ac86fbaa8b	mcq	<p> \\( k \\) এর মান কত হলে, \\( (k+1) x^{2}+ \\) \\( 2(k+3) x+2 k+3 \\) রাশিটি পূর্ণ বর্গ হবে? </p>	\N	<p>Solve: \\( (\\mathrm{k}+1) \\mathrm{x}^{2}+2(\\mathrm{k}+3) \\mathrm{x}+2 \\mathrm{k}+3 \\) রাশিটি পূর্ণ বর্গ বলে ,\\( \\left(k^{-}+1\\right) \\mathrm{x}^{2}+2(\\mathrm{k}+3) \\mathrm{x}+2 \\mathrm{k}+3=0 \\)</p>\n<p>সমীকরণের মূলগুলি সমান হবে এবং ফলে পৃথায়ক শূন্য হবে।</p>\n<p>\\( \\begin{array}{l} \\therefore\\{2(\\mathrm{k}+3)\\}^{2}-4(\\mathrm{k}+1)(2 \\mathrm{k}+3)=0 \\\\ \\left.\\Rightarrow 4\\left\\{\\mathrm{k}^{2}+6 \\mathrm{k}+9-2 \\mathrm{k}^{2}-5 \\mathrm{k}-3\\right)\\right\\}=0 \\\\ \\Rightarrow 4\\left\\{-\\mathrm{k}^{2}+\\mathrm{k}+6\\right\\}=0 \\Rightarrow \\mathrm{k}^{2}-\\mathrm{k}-6=0 \\\\ \\Rightarrow(\\mathrm{k}+2)(\\mathrm{k}-3)=0 \\quad \\therefore \\mathrm{k}=-2,3 \\text { (Ans.) } \\end{array} \\)</p>\n\n	published	\N	152	2026-10-03 16:36:29.150072+00	2026-10-03 16:36:29.150072+00
