01a10252-5b8a-7205-8532-0116abf727ab	01a101fc-a005-7517-bc3f-bb25fcff16a8	written	<p>\\( y=\\cos x \\ln \\left(\\frac{1}{\\sec x+\\tan x}\\right) \\) হলে, \\( \\frac{d^{2} y}{d x^{2}}+y \\) এর মান নির্ণয় কর। </p>	\N	<p>প্রথমে \\( y \\) কে সরলীকরণ করি:</p><p>\n</p><p>\\( y=\\cos x \\ln \\left(\\frac{1}{\\sec x+\\tan x}\\right)=-\\cos x \\ln (\\sec x+\\tan x) \\)</p><p>\n\n</p><p>প্রথম অন্তরক সহগ \\( \\frac{d y}{d x} \\) নির্ণয় করি:</p><p>\n</p><p>\\( \\begin{array}{c} \\frac{d y}{d x}=-\\cos x \\cdot \\frac{d}{d x}[\\ln (\\sec x+\\tan x)]-\\ln (\\sec x+\\tan x) \\cdot \\frac{d}{d x}(\\cos x) \\\\ \\frac{d y}{d x}=-\\cos x \\cdot \\frac{\\sec x \\tan x+\\sec ^{2} x}{\\sec x+\\tan x}-\\ln (\\sec x+\\tan x) \\cdot(-\\sin x) \\\\ \\frac{d y}{d x}=-\\cos x \\cdot \\frac{\\sec x(\\tan x+\\sec x)}{\\sec x+\\tan x}+\\sin x \\ln (\\sec x+\\tan x) \\end{array} \\)</p><p>\n</p><p>\\( \\frac{d y}{d x}=-\\cos x \\cdot \\sec x+\\sin x \\ln (\\sec x+\\tan x)=-1+\\sin x \\ln (\\sec x+\\tan x) \\)</p><p>\n\n</p><p>দ্বিতীয় অন্তরক সহগ \\( \\frac{d^{2} y}{d x^{2}} \\) নির্ণয় করি:</p><p>\n</p><p>\\( \\begin{array}{c} \\frac{d^{2} y}{d x^{2}}=\\frac{d}{d x}(-1+\\sin x \\ln (\\sec x+\\tan x)) \\\\ \\frac{d^{2} y}{d x^{2}}=\\cos x \\ln (\\sec x+\\tan x)+\\sin x \\cdot \\frac{\\sec x \\tan x+\\sec ^{2} x}{\\sec x+\\tan x} \\end{array} \\)</p><p>\n</p><p>\\( \\frac{d^{2} y}{d x^{2}}=\\cos x \\ln (\\sec x+\\tan x)+\\sin x \\cdot \\sec x=\\cos x \\ln (\\sec x+\\tan x)+\\tan x \\)</p><p> \\( \\frac{d^{2} y}{d x^{2}}+y \\) এর মান নির্ণয় করি:</p><p></p><p>\\( \\frac{d^{2} y}{d x^{2}}+y=\\cos x \\ln (\\sec x+\\tan x)+\\tan x-\\cos x \\ln (\\sec x+\\tan x)=\\tan x \\)</p>	published	\N	5	2026-10-03 15:11:54.297607+00	2026-10-03 15:11:54.297607+00
01a10252-607e-74ff-8633-48c0333f2f00	01a101fc-a003-71ac-8976-cc4c03f7c7f6	written	<p>নিচের বর্তনীতে \\( E=9 \\mathrm{~V}, R_{0}=2 \\Omega, R_{1}=6 \\Omega, R_{2}=4 \\Omega, R_{3}=8 \\Omega \\) হলে, বর্তনীতে বিদ্যুৎ প্রবাহ \\( i_{0} \\). \\( i_{1} \\) এবং\\( i_{23} \\) কত হবে?<img src="https://assets.chorcha.net/OGjeZFIa_NJU6yB-M3T2a.png" /></p>	\N	<p><img src="https://assets.chorcha.net/4NuMy33LlsJu6s0HoWPOM.png" /></p><p>\\( \\begin{array}{l}\\mathrm{R}_{\\mathrm{s}}=\\mathrm{R}_{2}+\\mathrm{R}_{3}=4+8=12 \\Omega \\\\ \\mathrm{R}_{\\mathrm{p}}=\\frac{\\mathrm{R}_{1} \\times \\mathrm{R}_{\\mathrm{s}}}{\\mathrm{R}_{1}+\\mathrm{R}_{\\mathrm{s}}}=\\frac{6 \\times 12}{6+12}=4 \\Omega \\\\ \\mathrm{R}_{\\mathrm{s}}^{\\prime}=4+2=6 \\Omega \\quad \\therefore \\mathrm{i}_{0}=\\frac{\\mathrm{E}}{\\mathrm{R}_{\\mathrm{s}}^{\\prime}}=\\frac{9}{6}=1.5 \\mathrm{~A} \\text { Ans. } \\\\ \\mathrm{i}_{1}=\\frac{12}{6+12} \\times 1.5=\\frac{12}{18} \\times 1.5=1 \\mathrm{~A} \\text { Ans. } \\\\ \\mathrm{i}_{23}=\\frac{6}{6+12} \\times 1.5=\\frac{6}{18} \\times 1.5=0.5 \\mathrm{~A} \\text { Ans. }\\end{array} \\)</p>	published	\N	6	2026-10-03 15:11:55.566453+00	2026-10-03 15:11:55.566453+00
