01a10365-fee5-70ea-860e-f718725139a9	01a101fc-a005-7517-bc3c-69d2b08f0f27	written	<p>যদি \\(A = \\begin{pmatrix} 1 &amp; i \\\\ -i &amp; 1 \\end{pmatrix}\\) এবং \\(B = \\begin{pmatrix} i &amp; -1 \\\\ -1 &amp; -i \\end{pmatrix}\\) হয়, তাহলে \\(AB = ?\\) (If \\(A = \\begin{pmatrix} 1 &amp; i \\\\ -i &amp; 1 \\end{pmatrix}\\) and \\(B = \\begin{pmatrix} i &amp; -1 \\\\ -1 &amp; -i \\end{pmatrix}\\), then \\(B^T A^T = ?\\))</p>	\N	<p>\\( A = \\begin{pmatrix} 1 &amp; i \\\\ -i &amp; 1 \\end{pmatrix}, B = \\begin{pmatrix} i &amp; -1 \\\\ -1 &amp; -i \\end{pmatrix} \\)</p><p>\\( AB = \\begin{pmatrix} 1 \\cdot i + i \\cdot (-1) &amp; 1 \\cdot (-1) + i \\cdot (-i) \\\\ (-i) \\cdot i + 1 \\cdot (-1) &amp; (-i) \\cdot (-1) + 1 \\cdot (-i) \\end{pmatrix} \\)</p><p>\\( = \\begin{pmatrix} i - i &amp; -1 - i^2 \\\\ -i^2 - 1 &amp; i - i \\end{pmatrix} \\)</p><p>\\( = \\begin{pmatrix} 0 &amp; -1 + 1 \\\\ 1 - 1 &amp; 0 \\end{pmatrix} \\)</p><p>\\( = \\begin{pmatrix} 0 &amp; 0 \\\\ 0 &amp; 0 \\end{pmatrix} \\)</p><p>তাহলে</p><p>\\( B^T A^T = (AB)^T = 0^T = \\begin{pmatrix} 0 &amp; 0 \\\\ 0 &amp; 0 \\end{pmatrix} \\)</p>	published	\N	4	2026-10-03 20:12:58.521845+00	2026-10-03 20:12:58.521845+00
01a10366-8509-7229-a90a-0ae38e4c565e	01a101fc-a005-7517-bc3f-ad8c63a6edb3	written	<p>যদি \\( x^3 + y^3 = 3axy \\) হয়, তাহলে \\( \\frac{dy}{dx} = ? \\) বাহির কর (If \\( x^3 + y^3 = 3axy \\), then find \\( \\frac{dy}{dx} = ? \\))</p>	\N	<p>প্রদত্ত সমীকরণ:</p><p>\\(x^3 + y^3 = 3axy\\)</p><p>অন্তর্নিহিত অন্তরীকরণ (implicit differentiation):</p><p>\\(\\frac{d}{dx}(x^3) + \\frac{d}{dx}(y^3) = \\frac{d}{dx}(3axy)\\)</p><p>\\(3x^2 + 3y^2 \\frac{dy}{dx} = 3a \\left(y + x \\frac{dy}{dx}\\right)\\)</p><p>\\(3x^2 + 3y^2 y' = 3ay + 3axy'\\)</p><p>উভয়পক্ষ 3 দিয়ে ভাগ করি:</p><p>\\(x^2 + y^2 y' = ay + axy'\\)</p><p></p><p>\\(y'\\) টার্মগুলো একপাশে নিই:</p><p>\\(y^2y' - axy' = ay - x^2\\)</p><p>\\(y'(y^2 - ax) = ay - x^2\\)</p><p>\\(y' = \\frac{ay - x^2}{y^2 - ax}\\)</p>	published	\N	21	2026-10-03 20:13:32.862198+00	2026-10-03 20:13:32.862198+00
01a10366-9ee4-73cf-90d6-3b8358442624	01a101fc-a005-7517-bc3f-d58619e5d5ed	written	<p>ইন্টিগ্রালটির মান নির্ণয় কর: \\(\\int_0^{\\pi/3} \\left( \\frac{\\cos x}{3+4 \\sin x} \\right) dx\\) (Evaluate the integral: \\(\\int_0^{\\pi/3} \\left( \\frac{\\cos x}{3+4 \\sin x} \\right) dx\\))</p>	\N	<p>প্রদত্ত সমাকলন:</p><p>\\( I = \\int_{0}^{\\pi/3} \\frac{\\cos x}{3 + 4 \\sin x} dx \\)</p><p>প্রতিস্থাপন (substitution):</p><p>\\( t = 3 + 4 \\sin x \\)</p><p>তাহলে:</p><p>\\( dt = 4 \\cos x dx \\implies \\cos x dx = \\frac{dt}{4} \\)</p><p></p><p></p><p>সীমা পরিবর্তন:</p><p>\n\n</p><p>যখন \\(x = 0\\):</p><p>\\(t = 3 + 4 \\sin 0 = 3 + 0 = 3\\)</p><p>\n\n</p><p>যখন \\(x = \\frac{\\pi}{3}\\):</p><p>\\(\\sin \\frac{\\pi}{3} = \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}\\)</p><p>\\(t = 3 + 4 \\cdot \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2} = 3 + 2\\sqrt{3}\\)</p><p>\n\n</p><p>সমাকলন:</p><p>\\(I = \\int_{t=3}^{t=3+2\\sqrt{3}} \\frac{1}{t} \\cdot \\frac{dt}{4}\\)</p><p>\\(= \\frac{1}{4} \\int_{3}^{3+2\\sqrt{3}} \\frac{dt}{t}\\)</p><p>\\(= \\frac{1}{4} [\\ln |t|]_{3}^{3+2\\sqrt{3}}\\)</p><p></p><p></p><p>\\( = \\frac{1}{4} \\left(\\ln(3 + 2\\sqrt{3}) - \\ln 3\\right) \\)</p><p>\\( = \\frac{1}{4} \\ln \\left(\\frac{3 + 2\\sqrt{3}}{3}\\right) \\)</p>	published	\N	24	2026-10-03 20:13:39.48055+00	2026-10-03 20:13:39.48055+00
