01a1026c-c295-72a1-b9e7-194deb28f1f9	\N	mcq	<p><strong>They like to keep their old houses rather than build new ones___it is very difficult and expensive to maintain them.</strong></p>	\N	<p>Certainly! Let's break down the sentence and explain the use of "even though":</p><p><strong>Original Sentence:</strong></p><p>"They like to keep their old houses rather than build new ones, even though it is very difficult and expensive to maintain them."</p><p><strong>Explanation:</strong></p><p>- <strong>"Even though":</strong> This is a subordinating conjunction used to introduce a contrast or concession. It is similar to "although" and is used to indicate a surprising or unexpected contrast between two clauses.</p><p><strong>Analysis:</strong></p><p>- <strong>"Even though" Usage:</strong></p><p>  - "Even though" is used to introduce the contrasting idea that it is difficult and expensive to maintain old houses.</p><p>  - It signals that there is a contrast between the preference for keeping old houses and the challenging aspect of maintaining them.</p><p>- <strong>Other Options:</strong></p><p>  - ক. "because": This conjunction indicates a cause-and-effect relationship, suggesting that maintaining old houses is difficult and expensive because they like to keep them. This doesn't capture the intended contrast.</p><p>  - গ. "on the contrary": This phrase is used to introduce a contrast or contradiction, but it doesn't fit well in this context. "Even though" is more appropriate for introducing a concession or unexpected contrast.</p><p>  - ঘ. "for example": This phrase is used to provide examples, and it doesn't fit the context of introducing a contrast between keeping old houses and the difficulty of maintaining them.</p><p><strong>In summary, option খ ("even though") is the correct choice,</strong> as it effectively introduces the unexpected contrast between the preference for keeping old houses and the acknowledged difficulty and expense of maintaining them.</p>	published	\N	76	2026-10-03 15:40:44.618184+00	2026-10-03 15:40:44.618184+00
