01a10292-488e-747c-a038-25505594e094	01a101fc-a002-7141-81c1-378ea838d979	mcq	<p>যদি\\(\\overrightarrow{AB}=2\\hat{i}+\\hat{j}\\)এবং\\(\\overrightarrow{AC}=3\\hat{i}-\\hat{j}+5\\hat{k}\\)হয় তবে,\\(\\overrightarrow{AB}\\)ও\\(\\overrightarrow{AC}\\)কে সন্নিহিত বাহু ধরে অংকিত সামান্তরিকের ক্ষেত্রফল-</p>	\N	<p>\\(\\overrightarrow{AB}\\times\\overrightarrow{AC}=\\begin{vmatrix}\\hat{i}&amp;\\hat{j}&amp;\\hat{k}\\\\2&amp;1&amp;0\\\\3&amp;-1&amp;5\\end{vmatrix}=\\left\\{\\hat{i}\\left(5-0\\right)-\\hat{j}\\left(10-0\\right)+\\hat{k}\\left(-2-3\\right)\\right\\}=\\left(5\\hat{i}-10\\hat{j}-5\\hat{k}\\right)\\)</p>\n<p>\\(\\therefore\\)ক্ষেত্রফল\\(=|\\overrightarrow{AB}\\times\\overrightarrow{AC}|=\\sqrt{5^2+10^2+5^2}=\\sqrt{150}=\\sqrt{25\\times6}=5\\sqrt{6}\\)</p>	published	\N	138	2026-10-03 16:21:43.748795+00	2026-10-03 16:21:43.748795+00
