01a10306-7a60-7445-8c5a-4bc413809923	\N	mcq	<p>\\( \\tan ^{2} x+\\sec ^{2} x=3 \\) এই সমীকরণটির সমাধান কর। Solve the equation of  \\( \\tan ^{2} x+\\sec ^{2} x=3 \\)</p>	\N	<p>সমীকরণটি হলো:</p><p>\\( \\tan^2 x + \\sec^2 x = 3 \\)</p><p>১. \\( \\sec^2 x \\) কে \\( \\tan^2 x \\) দিয়ে প্রকাশ</p><p>আমরা জানি:</p><p>\\( \\sec^2 x = 1 + \\tan^2 x \\)</p><p>২. প্রতিস্থাপন</p><p>\\( \\tan^2 x + (1 + \\tan^2 x) = 3 \\)</p><p>\\( 2 \\tan^2 x + 1 = 3 \\)</p><p>\\( 2 \\tan^2 x = 2 \\)</p><p>\\( \\tan^2 x = 1 \\)</p><p>সমাধান</p><p></p><p>\\( \\tan x = \\pm 1 \\)</p><p></p><p>সাধারণ সমাধান:</p><p></p><p>\\( \\tan x = 1 \\implies x = \\frac{\\pi}{4} + n\\pi \\)</p><p>\\( \\tan x = -1 \\implies x = -\\frac{\\pi}{4} + n\\pi = \\frac{3\\pi}{4} + n\\pi \\)</p><p>(উভয় ক্ষেত্রে \\(n \\in \\mathbb{Z}\\))</p>	published	\N	32	2026-10-03 18:28:38.683962+00	2026-10-03 18:28:38.683962+00
