01a10363-efb5-75eb-a420-42a829c65227	01a101fc-a005-7517-bc3f-9a861cca5b58	mcq	<p>যদি \\(y = \\sqrt{\\sec x}\\) হয়, তবে \\(\\frac{dy}{dx} = ?\\) (If \\(y = \\sqrt{\\sec x}\\), then \\(\\frac{dy}{dx} = ?\\))</p>	\N	<p>প্রদত্ত:</p><p>\\(y = \\sqrt{\\sec x} = (\\sec x)^{1/2}\\)</p><p>চেইন নিয়ম প্রয়োগ:</p><p>\\(\\frac{dy}{dx} = \\frac{1}{2}(\\sec x)^{-1/2} \\cdot \\frac{d}{dx}(\\sec x)\\)</p><p>\\(\\frac{d}{dx}(\\sec x) = \\sec x \\tan x\\)</p><p>তাই,</p><p>\\(\\frac{dy}{dx} = \\frac{1}{2}(\\sec x)^{-1/2} \\cdot \\sec x \\tan x\\)</p><p>\\(= \\frac{1}{2}(\\sec x)^{1-1/2} \\tan x\\)</p><p>\\(= \\frac{1}{2}(\\sec x)^{1/2} \\tan x\\)</p><p>যেহেতু \\(y = \\sqrt{\\sec x}\\),</p><p>\\(\\frac{dy}{dx} = \\frac{1}{2}y \\tan x\\)</p>	published	\N	73	2026-10-03 20:10:43.562139+00	2026-10-03 20:10:43.562139+00
