01a10363-0b34-7656-8be5-c067cceeea22	\N	mcq	<p>cos \\(2\\theta = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\) সমীকরণের সাধারণ সমাধান কোনটি? (What is the general solution of the equation cos \\(2\\theta = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\)?)</p>	\N	<p>প্রদত্ত:</p><p>\\(\\cos 2\\theta = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\)</p><p>আমরা জানি:</p><p>\\(\\cos \\phi = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} \\Rightarrow \\phi = \\frac{\\pi}{4} + 2n\\pi, \\text{ অথবা } \\phi = -\\frac{\\pi}{4} + 2n\\pi\\)</p><p>যেখানে \\(n \\in \\mathbb{Z}\\)</p><p>এখানে \\(\\phi = 2\\theta\\)</p><p>তাহলে:</p><p>\\(2\\theta = \\frac{\\pi}{4} + 2n\\pi\\)</p><p>\\(\\theta = \\frac{\\pi}{8} + n\\pi\\)</p><p>অথবা:</p><p>\\(2\\theta = -\\frac{\\pi}{4} + 2n\\pi\\)</p><p>\\(\\theta = -\\frac{\\pi}{8} + n\\pi\\)</p>	published	\N	41	2026-10-03 20:09:45.064061+00	2026-10-03 20:09:45.064061+00
