01a10363-c50a-75ca-8991-0df15ce23f6f	\N	mcq	<p>যদি \\(Q_d = 100 - 2P\\) এবং \\(Q_s = 20 + 3P\\) হয়, তবে ভারসাম্য দাম ও পরিমাণ কত?(If \\(Q_d = 100 - 2P\\) and \\(Q_s = 20 + 3P\\), What will be the equilibrium price and quantity?)</p>	\N	<p>\\(Q_d = 100 - 2P\\)</p><p>\\(Q_s = 20 + 3P\\)</p><p><br />Step 1: Equilibrium condition</p><p>\\(Q_d = Q_s\\)</p><p>\\(100 - 2P = 20 + 3P\\)</p><p><br />Step 2: Solve for P</p><p>\\(100 - 20 = 3P + 2P\\)</p><p>\\(80 = 5P\\)</p><p>\\(P = \\frac{80}{5} = 16\\)</p><p>Step 3: Solve for Q</p><p>\\(Q = Q_d = 100 - 2P = 100 - 2(16) = 100 - 32 = 68\\)</p><p><br /> **সঠিক উত্তর:**খ) P = 16, Q = 68</p>	published	\N	67	2026-10-03 20:10:32.638272+00	2026-10-03 20:10:32.638272+00
