01a10364-bead-7629-963a-349c82e44734	01a101fc-a005-7517-bc3f-d58619e5d5ed	mcq	<p>\\(\\int_{0}^{1} e^{-2x} dx\\)-এর মান কোনটি? (Which is the value of \\(\\int_{0}^{1} e^{-2x} dx\\)?)</p>	\N	<p>সমাকলন:</p><p>\\( \\int e^{-2x} dx = \\frac{e^{-2x}}{-2} + C \\)</p><p>সুনির্দিষ্ট সমাকলন:</p><p>\\( \\int_{0}^{1} e^{-2x} dx = \\left[ -\\frac{1}{2}e^{-2x} \\right]_{0}^{1} \\)</p><p>মান বসিয়ে:</p><p>\\( = -\\frac{1}{2}e^{-2} - \\left( -\\frac{1}{2}e^{0} \\right) \\)</p><p>\\( = -\\frac{1}{2}e^{-2} + \\frac{1}{2} \\)</p><p>\\( = \\frac{1}{2}(1 - e^{-2}) \\)</p>	published	\N	101	2026-10-03 20:11:36.54697+00	2026-10-03 20:11:36.54697+00
